"received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/commit/32227fba2b031e666f253a633c85160abee798ca","node_id":"C_kwDOQZHnxNoAKDMyMjI3ZmJhMmIwMzFlNjY2ZjI1M2E2MzNjODUxNjBhYmVlNzk4Y2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/commit/b3aac4663d27893ef52dd21c586d0cb4a3bab1a9","sha":"b3aac4663d27893ef52dd21c586d0cb4a3bab1a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/commits/b3aac4663d27893ef52dd21c586d0cb4a3bab1a9"}],"sha":"32227fba2b031e666f253a633c85160abee798ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/commits/32227fba2b031e666f253a633c85160abee798ca"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8714327?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM","id":8714327,"login":"WolffM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MTQzMjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/commits/b3aac4663d27893ef52dd21c586d0cb4a3bab1a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T21:46:46Z","email":"8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com","name":"WolffM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T21:46:46Z","email":"8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com","name":"WolffM"},"message":"feat(mailfeed): a scoped mail read surface, so one service can see one class of sender\n\njobplatform needs the ATS confirmations that arrive at matthaeus@hadoku.me —\nthey are the only record of whether an application was really sent that is not\nproduced by the thing doing the sending. It must not need a credential that can\nalso read the rest of the mailbox.\n\nhadoku.me has no IMAP server (MX is Resend/SES inbound → webhook → D1), so\nthere is no folder to scope a credential to. The mail is already a queryable\ntable, which turns out to be a better place to draw the line.\n\n/contact/api/mailfeed is a THIRD prefix because it is gated by a third policy.\n/service admits any service key by design; this admits none of them without an\nexplicit per-identity grant. The admission rule in AGENTS.md is answered rather\nthan waived: tier is necessary and not sufficient, since the caller must also\nbe named in MAILFEED_SCOPES with a list of sender domains. Identity comes from\nX-User-Id, which edge-router strips from the client and re-injects from the key\nregistry — it needs injectUserId on the mount, and 403s as unidentified\nwithout it.\n\nEvery exclusion is SQL, not a post-fetch filter: outbound rows (whose `email`\nis the RECIPIENT and whose body is the operator''s own words), non-Resend\nuser_agents (the ONLY discriminator in the archive, which has no `direction`\ncolumn), quarantined mail (else a blocked sender reaches a consumer by forging\na From domain), and deleted mail. Each is pinned independently — seven\nmutations, seven distinct failures.\n\nReads the archive alongside the live table, so the history is the whole history\nrather than the 30 days before archiveOldSubmissions moves it. Paging is\nascending on (created_at, id), which makes the backfill and the steady-state\npoll the same call instead of two implementations of the same matching rules.\n\nAlso repoints five comments at AGENTS.md; CLAUDE.md has been a one-line stub\npointing back at it since the migration.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"174c59d573aac80bd87409395ec54f3dde3af9d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/git/trees/174c59d573aac80bd87409395ec54f3dde3af9d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/git/commits/b3aac4663d27893ef52dd21c586d0cb4a3bab1a9","verification":{"payload":"tree 174c59d573aac80bd87409395ec54f3dde3af9d1\nparent b2de8f0abf8925c461155b83145adae19c000150\nauthor WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1789854406 -0700\ncommitter WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1789854406 -0700\n\nfeat(mailfeed): a scoped mail read surface, so one service can see one class of sender\n\njobplatform needs the ATS confirmations that arrive at matthaeus@hadoku.me —\nthey are the only record of whether an application was really sent that is not\nproduced by the thing doing the sending. It must not need a credential that can\nalso read the rest of the mailbox.\n\nhadoku.me has no IMAP server (MX is Resend/SES inbound → webhook → D1), so\nthere is no folder to scope a credential to. The mail is already a queryable\ntable, which turns out to be a better place to draw the line.\n\n/contact/api/mailfeed is a THIRD prefix because it is gated by a third policy.\n/service admits any service key by design; this admits none of them without an\nexplicit per-identity grant. The admission rule in AGENTS.md is answered rather\nthan waived: tier is necessary and not sufficient, since the caller must also\nbe named in MAILFEED_SCOPES with a list of sender domains. Identity comes from\nX-User-Id, which edge-router strips from the client and re-injects from the key\nregistry — it needs injectUserId on the mount, and 403s as unidentified\nwithout it.\n\nEvery exclusion is SQL, not a post-fetch filter: outbound rows (whose `email`\nis the RECIPIENT and whose body is the operator''s own words), non-Resend\nuser_agents (the ONLY discriminator in the archive, which has no `direction`\ncolumn), quarantined mail (else a blocked sender reaches a consumer by forging\na From domain), and deleted mail. Each is pinned independently — seven\nmutations, seven distinct failures.\n\nReads the archive alongside the live table, so the history is the whole history\nrather than the 30 days before archiveOldSubmissions moves it. Paging is\nascending on (created_at, id), which makes the backfill and the steady-state\npoll the same call instead of two implementations of the same matching rules.\n\nAlso repoints five comments at AGENTS.md; CLAUDE.md has been a one-line stub\npointing back at it since the migration.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgtExEZCroNtll/b5fn53fujqeNd\nwjYFlHwlmteH8Ve7QAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQMJYsc7nQx6vUZmSkXF31r9Bwdig9ZrhZLyKd8CPCDJld2IS7CMGcrxIaN2SJPfN21\nTZJO+FJLqxySyi45krEgM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-19T21:51:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8714327?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM","id":8714327,"login":"WolffM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MTQzMjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/commit/b3aac4663d27893ef52dd21c586d0cb4a3bab1a9","node_id":"C_kwDOQZHnxNoAKGIzYWFjNDY2M2QyNzg5M2VmNTJkZDIxYzU4NmQwY2I0YTNiYWIxYTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/commit/b2de8f0abf8925c461155b83145adae19c000150","sha":"b2de8f0abf8925c461155b83145adae19c000150","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/commits/b2de8f0abf8925c461155b83145adae19c000150"}],"sha":"b3aac4663d27893ef52dd21c586d0cb4a3bab1a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/commits/b3aac4663d27893ef52dd21c586d0cb4a3bab1a9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8714327?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM","id":8714327,"login":"WolffM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MTQzMjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/commits/b2de8f0abf8925c461155b83145adae19c000150/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T21:06:15Z","email":"8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com","name":"WolffM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T21:06:15Z","email":"8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com","name":"WolffM"},"message":"chore(devvault): drop two dead Cloudflare token declarations\n\nUI_CLOUDFLARE_WORKER_FLUSH_TOKEN is dead at Cloudflare — /user/tokens/verify\nreturns ''Invalid API Token'' (checked 2026-09-19). It was declared here and in\nhadoku-task-mobile and read by code in neither repo, which is the only reason\nhadoku_site''s check:vault-orphans stayed green on it: a .devvault.json mapping\ncounts as a reference, so a credential declared but never read is invisible.\n\nCLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN_MIGRATION was a break-glass override for a D1 key migration\nthat has run. Its two callers in hadoku_site already fell back to\nCLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN, which carries D1; both lost the override in 4dfd2844.\n\nBoth vault items are being deleted. Declaring a name the vault no longer holds\nmakes dev-vault exit 1 for every caller in this repo, so these go together.","tree":{"sha":"aa3418d6165122008605e72f48f8304e27f0beda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/git/trees/aa3418d6165122008605e72f48f8304e27f0beda"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/git/commits/b2de8f0abf8925c461155b83145adae19c000150","verification":{"payload":"tree aa3418d6165122008605e72f48f8304e27f0beda\nparent 9361a67aa7a489feee4bbdc6f3c66e22229c413b\nauthor WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1789851975 -0700\ncommitter WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1789851975 -0700\n\nchore(devvault): drop two dead Cloudflare token declarations\n\nUI_CLOUDFLARE_WORKER_FLUSH_TOKEN is dead at Cloudflare — /user/tokens/verify\nreturns ''Invalid API Token'' (checked 2026-09-19). It was declared here and in\nhadoku-task-mobile and read by code in neither repo, which is the only reason\nhadoku_site''s check:vault-orphans stayed green on it: a .devvault.json mapping\ncounts as a reference, so a credential declared but never read is invisible.\n\nCLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN_MIGRATION was a break-glass override for a D1 key migration\nthat has run. Its two callers in hadoku_site already fell back to\nCLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN, which carries D1; both lost the override in 4dfd2844.\n\nBoth vault items are being deleted. Declaring a name the vault no longer holds\nmakes dev-vault exit 1 for every caller in this repo, so these go together.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgtExEZCroNtll/b5fn53fujqeNd\nwjYFlHwlmteH8Ve7QAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQG/W+kWJ1NA7E6x2o/BByACif/XX9YO1neOihlDlvVxLGQfvE/2U+SySuibfSAhjbT\nuFBgZQwPhZ7lxVUlEI+Q8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-19T21:06:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8714327?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM","id":8714327,"login":"WolffM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MTQzMjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/commit/b2de8f0abf8925c461155b83145adae19c000150","node_id":"C_kwDOQZHnxNoAKGIyZGU4ZjBhYmY4OTI1YzQ2MTE1N