5e7a6fc596e385835c","node_id":"C_kwDOQZHnxNoAKGQ3M2M5M2RiY2QxYzEzOTgyYzJlNjE1ZTdhNmZjNTk2ZTM4NTgzNWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/commit/f4b0ccfe44949576520df6699fa15757efcf2c06","sha":"f4b0ccfe44949576520df6699fa15757efcf2c06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/commits/f4b0ccfe44949576520df6699fa15757efcf2c06"}],"sha":"d73c93dbcd1c13982c2e615e7a6fc596e385835c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/commits/d73c93dbcd1c13982c2e615e7a6fc596e385835c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8714327?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM","id":8714327,"login":"WolffM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MTQzMjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/commits/f4b0ccfe44949576520df6699fa15757efcf2c06/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T21:12:09Z","email":"8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com","name":"WolffM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T21:14:42Z","email":"8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com","name":"WolffM"},"message":"fix(email): stop saying everything twice in the confirmation\n\nThe join link was printed under both \"Meeting Link:\" and \"WHAT TO\nEXPECT\", so every confirmation carried the same URL twice — which reads\nas a mistake. Three separate paragraphs asked the reader to reply.\n\nAlso:\n  - the signature said \"Matthaeus Wolf\", twice;\n  - the timezone printed as \"America/Los_Angeles\", the IANA id the\n    database stores, rather than \"PDT\" — nobody says \"2:45 PM\n    America/Los_Angeles\" out loud;\n  - the platform printed raw, so \"google\" rather than \"Google Meet\";\n  - a private space invite was described like a shared server invite,\n    though it works once and belongs to one guest, so passing it on\n    would cost them their own way in.\n\nThe link is now printed once, under \"Join here\", and the platform block\nbelow it never repeats it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017Nkkvti6vN2JUcTCrCXpxR","tree":{"sha":"3f08c54f764c05e5e7976947b2e81669c2f15b34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/git/trees/3f08c54f764c05e5e7976947b2e81669c2f15b34"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/git/commits/f4b0ccfe44949576520df6699fa15757efcf2c06","verification":{"payload":"tree 3f08c54f764c05e5e7976947b2e81669c2f15b34\nparent 123555876e532a2a53bad3abe609c36268b09a66\nauthor WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1789506729 -0700\ncommitter WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1789506882 -0700\n\nfix(email): stop saying everything twice in the confirmation\n\nThe join link was printed under both \"Meeting Link:\" and \"WHAT TO\nEXPECT\", so every confirmation carried the same URL twice — which reads\nas a mistake. Three separate paragraphs asked the reader to reply.\n\nAlso:\n  - the signature said \"Matthaeus Wolf\", twice;\n  - the timezone printed as \"America/Los_Angeles\", the IANA id the\n    database stores, rather than \"PDT\" — nobody says \"2:45 PM\n    America/Los_Angeles\" out loud;\n  - the platform printed raw, so \"google\" rather than \"Google Meet\";\n  - a private space invite was described like a shared server invite,\n    though it works once and belongs to one guest, so passing it on\n    would cost them their own way in.\n\nThe link is now printed once, under \"Join here\", and the platform block\nbelow it never repeats it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017Nkkvti6vN2JUcTCrCXpxR\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgtExEZCroNtll/b5fn53fujqeNd\nwjYFlHwlmteH8Ve7QAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQDXVNBfMPWgj1J4njMfsM77vwv04IJY57BKXMm/pgdDIoQQDGqHhLR6/jZSrhZjWRO\nBlHjtjmOVCh6yOjRdcZwI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-15T21:15:13Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8714327?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM","id":8714327,"login":"WolffM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MTQzMjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/commit/f4b0ccfe44949576520df6699fa15757efcf2c06","node_id":"C_kwDOQZHnxNoAKGY0YjBjY2ZlNDQ5NDk1NzY1MjBkZjY2OTlmYTE1NzU3ZWZjZjJjMDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/commit/123555876e532a2a53bad3abe609c36268b09a66","sha":"123555876e532a2a53bad3abe609c36268b09a66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/commits/123555876e532a2a53bad3abe609c36268b09a66"}],"sha":"f4b0ccfe44949576520df6699fa15757efcf2c06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/commits/f4b0ccfe44949576520df6699fa15757efcf2c06"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8714327?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM","id":8714327,"login":"WolffM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MTQzMjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/commits/123555876e532a2a53bad3abe609c36268b09a66/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T21:12:09Z","email":"8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com","name":"WolffM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T21:14:42Z","email":"8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com","name":"WolffM"},"message":"fix(booking): a booking blocks every slot it overlaps\n\n`slot_id` is `slot-<date>-<startISO>` and carries no duration, so a\n15-minute booking at 21:45 shares an id with neither the 30-minute slot\nat 21:30 nor the 60-minute one at 21:00. Availability matched on that\nid, so both stayed on offer — and the submit path used the same\ncomparison, so it accepted the overlapping booking rather than\nanswering 409.\n\nVerified read-only against production on 2026-09-15: a live 21:45-22:00\nbooking showed 21:30-22:00 and 21:00-22:00 as `available: true`.\n\nisSlotAvailable and getBookedSlotIdsInRange are replaced by\nisRangeAvailable, getBookedIntervalsInRange and overlapsBooked — a\nhalf-open comparison, so back-to-back meetings are still not a conflict.\nBoth slot endpoints and both booking paths now use it, since offering a\nslot the submit path would refuse is the same bug seen from the other\nend.\n\nThe old suite could not have caught this: it only ever asserted the\nsame-start case, which was the one case that worked.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017Nkkvti6vN2JUcTCrCXpxR","tree":{"sha":"89c4e646482be8b084dffe785f53311b03e46c0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/git/trees/89c4e646482be8b084dffe785f53311b03e46c0b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/git/commits/123555876e532a2a53bad3abe609c36268b09a66","verification":{"payload":"tree 89c4e646482be8b084dffe785f53311b03e46c0b\nparent cc38631fc290079bd63daccd8e84430616fae060\nauthor WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1789506729 -0700\ncommitter WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1789506882 -0700\n\nfix(booking): a booking blocks every slot it overlaps\n\n`slot_id` is `slot-<date>-<startISO>` and carries no duration, so a\n15-minute booking at 21:45 shares an id with neither the 30-minute slot\nat 21:30 nor the 60-minute one at 21:00. Availability matched on that\nid, so both stayed on offer — and the submit path used the same\ncomparison, so it accepted the overlapping booking rather than\nanswering 409.\n\nVerified read-only against production on 2026-09-15: a live 21:45-22:00\nbooking showed 21:30-22:00 and 21:00-22:00 as `available: true`.\n\nisSlotAvailable and getBookedSlotIdsInRange are replaced by\nisRangeAvailable, getBookedIntervalsInRange and overlapsBooked — a\nhalf-open comparison, so back-to-back meetings are still not a conflict.\nBoth slot endpoints and both booking paths now use it, since offering a\nslot the submit path would refuse is the same bug seen from the other\nend.\n\nThe old suite could not have caught this: it only ever asserted the\nsame-start case, which was the one case that worked.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017Nkkvti6vN2JUcTCrCXpxR\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgtExEZCroNtll/b5fn53fujqeNd\nwjYFlHwlmteH8Ve7QAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQLa8q56nXBsjyQ0bs8OXwR0rlp+CWHlwgB2M5By8/J9XXrfF95eLT4Aa4/abc5gDjR\n97FL7yUEffQf2J7T3m8QQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-15T21:15:13Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8714327?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM","id":8714327,"login":"WolffM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MTQzMjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/commit/123555876e532a2a53bad3abe609c36268b09a66","nod