ithub.com","name":"github-actions[bot]"},"message":"chore: auto-update @wolffm/* to latest","tree":{"sha":"99e50346e6bc1c47b75e7eb01696815887fe1fad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/git/trees/99e50346e6bc1c47b75e7eb01696815887fe1fad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/git/commits/cc38631fc290079bd63daccd8e84430616fae060","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","id":41898282,"login":"github-actions[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/commit/cc38631fc290079bd63daccd8e84430616fae060","node_id":"C_kwDOQZHnxNoAKGNjMzg2MzFmYzI5MDA3OWJkNjNkYWNjZDhlODQ0MzA2MTZmYWUwNjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/commit/a9d420cd266f43536cf6a3deb3b288c554a3bd8f","sha":"a9d420cd266f43536cf6a3deb3b288c554a3bd8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/commits/a9d420cd266f43536cf6a3deb3b288c554a3bd8f"}],"sha":"cc38631fc290079bd63daccd8e84430616fae060","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/commits/cc38631fc290079bd63daccd8e84430616fae060"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8714327?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM","id":8714327,"login":"WolffM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MTQzMjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/commits/a9d420cd266f43536cf6a3deb3b288c554a3bd8f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T20:38:01Z","email":"8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com","name":"WolffM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T20:38:13Z","email":"8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com","name":"WolffM"},"message":"feat(calendar): put the booking in the task''s notes, and stop mirroring mail\n\nTwo complaints about the mirrored task board, one cause each.\n\nThe meeting task carried every useful field — who booked it, the join link,\ntheir message, the platform — in `metadata` alone. The task board renders\n`notes` and does not render `metadata`, so what landed on the board was a bare\n\"Meeting: <name>\" and the detail was reachable only by expanding the event on\nthe calendar page. Now the same detail is also rendered as a markdown body in\n`notes`: a fact list plus the guest''s message under its own `## Message`\nheading, with the slot printed in the BOOKING''s timezone (the board renders\nstartTime/endTime in the viewer''s). Metadata stays as the machine-readable\ncopy. Fields an admin-created entry lacks are omitted rather than printed\nempty, and an `Intl`-unusable timezone degrades to the duration instead of\nthrowing — the mirror is best-effort and must never fail a booking.\n\nAdmin outbound mail was mirrored as an all-day event per send. A sent email is\nnot a calendar event and not a task, so that duplicated the mail record onto\nthe board as \"Mail: <subject>\" with nothing to do about it. Removed rather than\nreshaped: the builder, both push/remove helpers, the send-time push and the\ntrash-time retraction (which was the only reason the delete path re-read the\nsubmission before soft-deleting it).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8041b27b38f5f27a22f26e4a2c5da2dc5ad0c328","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/git/trees/8041b27b38f5f27a22f26e4a2c5da2dc5ad0c328"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/git/commits/a9d420cd266f43536cf6a3deb3b288c554a3bd8f","verification":{"payload":"tree 8041b27b38f5f27a22f26e4a2c5da2dc5ad0c328\nparent 78c6ac8b95304171f97f41a2224ab780b4d5bf75\nauthor WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1789504681 -0700\ncommitter WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1789504693 -0700\n\nfeat(calendar): put the booking in the task''s notes, and stop mirroring mail\n\nTwo complaints about the mirrored task board, one cause each.\n\nThe meeting task carried every useful field — who booked it, the join link,\ntheir message, the platform — in `metadata` alone. The task board renders\n`notes` and does not render `metadata`, so what landed on the board was a bare\n\"Meeting: <name>\" and the detail was reachable only by expanding the event on\nthe calendar page. Now the same detail is also rendered as a markdown body in\n`notes`: a fact list plus the guest''s message under its own `## Message`\nheading, with the slot printed in the BOOKING''s timezone (the board renders\nstartTime/endTime in the viewer''s). Metadata stays as the machine-readable\ncopy. Fields an admin-created entry lacks are omitted rather than printed\nempty, and an `Intl`-unusable timezone degrades to the duration instead of\nthrowing — the mirror is best-effort and must never fail a booking.\n\nAdmin outbound mail was mirrored as an all-day event per send. A sent email is\nnot a calendar event and not a task, so that duplicated the mail record onto\nthe board as \"Mail: <subject>\" with nothing to do about it. Removed rather than\nreshaped: the builder, both push/remove helpers, the send-time push and the\ntrash-time retraction (which was the only reason the delete path re-read the\nsubmission before soft-deleting it).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgtExEZCroNtll/b5fn53fujqeNd\nwjYFlHwlmteH8Ve7QAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQGj+nCRO+cNghS2etREOJ05YAlrJ8MAGzwDwcrdNZtVjmWUkMJgnWNIO+JuuiTMDrh\nOtvKVihFSRG7pUI1sEsQw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-15T20:43:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8714327?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WolffM","id":8714327,"login":"WolffM","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MTQzMjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/org