stinguishable.\n\npublic/ is dev-only, so build.copyPublicDir is off: this repo builds in lib\nmode and the bundle is mounted into a page that already serves /favicon.svg.\nWithout the guard Vite copies the asset into dist/ and it ships in the\npublished package, unread. (Verified by building: dist/ has no favicon.svg.)","tree":{"sha":"1aded56385ab1f7914c3856e8c58277a2b8d8b5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/git/trees/1aded56385ab1f7914c3856e8c58277a2b8d8b5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolffM/hadoku-contact-ui/git/commits/19271f668d9124577902764ade8de7185f8a22f7","verification":{"payload":"tree 1aded56385ab1f7914c3856e8c58277a2b8d8b5f\nparent 1b8a5e0ed98aedcd8e3a29e694f01cbf9df65672\nauthor WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1786654882 -0700\ncommitter WolffM <8714327+WolffM@users.noreply.github.com> 1786655302 -0700\n\nchore: add the site favicon to the dev harness\n\nEvery app on hadoku.me gets its icon from Base.astro, so production tabs were\nalways fine — but running this repo standalone gave a blank browser-default\nicon, which makes several open dev tabs indistinguishable.\n\npublic/ is dev-only, so build.copyPublicDir is off: this repo builds in lib\nmode and the bundle is mounted into a page that already serves /favicon.svg.\nWithout the guard Vite copies the asset into dist/ and it ships in the\npublished package, unread. (Verified by building: dist/ has no favicon.svg.)\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgtExEZCroNtll/b5fn53fujqeNd\nwjYFlHwlmteH8Ve7QAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQCMx3GKIyvj72PgrrIAOfMmRl3GnNFBc1Sy+XRj4HgoIOP6qWjrHuhqUXJR1SNAY8I\nH1DbYoS9oTBgXFC08svQ4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-13T21:14:44Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8714327?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolffM/events{/privacy}","follow