d019e183058a8500d964e45d"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T20:57:55.542Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29648197?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saviomurungi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saviomurungi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saviomurungi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saviomurungi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/saviomurungi","id":29648197,"login":"saviomurungi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NjQ4MTk3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saviomurungi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saviomurungi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saviomurungi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saviomurungi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saviomurungi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/saviomurungi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohuganda/moh-sso-dashboard/commits/5925284a91ee47aaa0530352bfff67946e4d9e66/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:21:32Z","email":"saviomurungik@gmail.com","name":"Savio Murungi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:21:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Apply the run scope to raw_sql rules and drop the date picker from the modal (#242)\n\nA scoped run silently ignored raw_sql rules: compileRawSQL wrapped the rule''s\nown SQL and discarded the row filter, so a run scoped to one district counted\nviolations nationwide and reported them under that district. The filter is now\napplied outside the rule''s query, where it cannot disturb the rule''s own SQL.\n\nThe schedule modal also never opened. It was the only place using Carbon''s\nDatePicker, which pulls in flatpickr, while the rest of the page uses components\nalready proven to load. A native datetime input removes that dependency.","tree":{"sha":"72d0d68699168d15530a2fa9b46e36f49d371dc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohuganda/moh-sso-dashboard/git/trees/72d0d68699168d15530a2fa9b46e36f49d371dc4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohuganda/moh-sso-dashboard/git/commits/5925284a91ee47aaa0530352bfff67946e4d9e66","verification":{"payload":"tree 72d0d68699168d15530a2fa9b46e36f49d371dc4\nparent 889be7f06983c80584c489720d9410ec8a6d2f9f\nauthor Savio Murungi <saviomurungik@gmail.com> 1791379292 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791379292 +0300\n\nApply the run scope to raw_sql rules and drop the date picker from the modal (#242)\n\nA scoped run silently ignored raw_sql rules: compileRawSQL wrapped the rule''s\nown SQL and discarded the row filter, so a run scoped to one district counted\nviolations nationwide and reported them under that district. The filter is now\napplied outside the rule''s query, where it cannot disturb the rule''s own SQL.\n\nThe schedule modal also never opened. It was the only place using Carbon''s\nDatePicker, which pulls in flatpickr, while the rest of the page uses components\nalready proven to load. A native datetime input removes that dependency.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxkdcCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGiUQAKNErPyaPFQE5D2uckO534Gt\n5lX7fEhO8qjpDNdgIYFz3iYq/7xDzMvesIYNdCzSmi0kxWIBcGvshuY1gBTGwhlb\nTeHDc9J+sNQbMq1M9+c4pnrsPTqiv1H6Y80YxUtYKYoyOQeITTJ70ZTvfpa/7jc2\nxBSVWZRW7ox8BZbkCW2yuYqfuq3R1FwlpWrb1nxhlN+S2yxtw4ePpUFIR/C8LHIn\ndaurqrH4tbBbGDGtQhOvv2TqcG+QcNnUqom8+J2qkJyPK+YTYH6O3mJ8a4X3oUW8\nsIkGBAkAOTM2JVp0wKkzOLaosbE3s95utxR9gLxF5LVT0dHnV1vZIXXpSgOvOR3c\nmBuChpezkhPmVl1ADEd5jxgCpGVQ9xrwIyARC+v8yZ2BCj7t1TW6vgnRqO32EH+G\nBCnWg1QJsUldSL8puBHrjwd1SEipj2uOMqWEE8pz9wm7Lg3foBJuq/BZknCSPtD2\n8q6R6dvPDLNo9INQHFfRgDerHnvtRq/AobTqjbvGIwcG6KAlIk+oRmt7Gk4WeAJ5\noBCrhzGxfc1/Pr/xI5CSrOwLXZGHd5BhrI/B8d4nwwSHRHQmKSDxlkCq99TJ+J7u\nFuQIEkmQlHXqqEGgJ17UZ2clDFwDKt