omurungi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saviomurungi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saviomurungi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saviomurungi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/saviomurungi","id":29648197,"login":"saviomurungi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NjQ4MTk3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saviomurungi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saviomurungi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saviomurungi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saviomurungi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saviomurungi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/saviomurungi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohuganda/moh-sso-dashboard/commits/2a8c90c92c28742974143b31c11b17c133d456ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T10:34:00Z","email":"saviomurungik@gmail.com","name":"SavioMurungi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T10:34:00Z","email":"saviomurungik@gmail.com","name":"SavioMurungi"},"message":"Add the DQA changes to existing files that the previous commit omitted\n\nThe previous commit added the new DQA files but none of the edits to existing\nfiles, so the build was broken: the new components import types and hooks that\nwere never added to dqa.types.ts and dqa.api.ts, and run_scope.go reads table\nconfiguration fields that were never added to the store. Typecheck failed with\nthirteen missing-export errors.\n\nBrings across the modifications and the two seed-file deletions that belong with\nthem: per-table period, dimension and filter columns, the columns endpoint,\nrule mapping and schedule routes, run scoping, the schedule worker wiring, and\nthe frontend types, API endpoints, tag type and panel changes.","tree":{"sha":"5c812fba2bf840b1dc4b3