"date":"2026-09-10T12:59:54Z","email":"saviomurungik@gmail.com","name":"SavioMurungi"},"message":"Store DQA results in the dqa schema and promote flag filter dimensions\n\nThe engine targeted a dqa_v2 schema, but the DWH role has no database-level\nCREATE and Postgres checks that privilege before the IF NOT EXISTS\nshort-circuit, so the whole DDL batch failed at boot and every DQA endpoint\nreturned 500. Point the engine at the existing dqa schema, run CREATE SCHEMA\nseparately as best-effort, and persist results over a dedicated connection\n(DQA_DB_USERNAME/PASSWORD) owned by the dqa schema''s role — source tables are\nstill read over the DWH connection, which the Issue Tracker also uses.\n\nFlags now carry year, month, region, district, subcounty, village, facility\nand vht as indexed columns so the dashboard can filter on them, resolved via\nper-dataset aliases because the facility-level matview and the VHT form spell\nthem differently. Remaining identifying values are captured instead of a fixed\nthree-column list.","tree":{"sha":"40c1e746b85a0f892651e86fc3f6bd9dab060fd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohuganda/moh-sso-dashboard/git/trees/40c1e746b85a0f892651e86fc3f6bd9dab060fd1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohuganda/moh-sso-dashboard/git/commits/f5c8a2c7161bbea8365bf204659be1b025250463","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29648197?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saviomurungi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saviomurungi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saviomurungi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saviomurungi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/saviomurungi","id":29648197,"login":"saviomurungi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NjQ4MTk3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/savi