\nstrict CSRF enforcement to be enabled. When reverting that PR, we need\nto adapt the test to account for both cases.\n\n* Fix newer tests to use older setting\n\n(cherry picked from commit d3eb6cbf1cebef4f8a2a9972b6e33fd031e37c5e)\n\nCo-authored-by: Alejandro García Montoro <alejandro.garciamontoro@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"262ad75876fa2ce784acbd8ed5bbf5a31a615176","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ethancroissants/mostlymatter/git/trees/262ad75876fa2ce784acbd8ed5bbf5a31a615176"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ethancroissants/mostlymatter/git/commits/733e878e03625be0e9d739f3c97a57841c21e1b5","verification":{"payload":"tree 262ad75876fa2ce784acbd8ed5bbf5a31a615176\nparent 6b61997b1cf3947caab2090fdba01ca0c55fd3d4\nauthor Mattermost Build <build@mattermost.com> 1760121516 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1760121516 +0200\n\nRevert \"MM-13657: Set ExperimentalStrictCSRFEnforcement to true by default (#33444)\" (#34112) (#34113)\n\n* Revert \"MM-13657: Set ExperimentalStrictCSRFEnforcement to true by default (#33444)\"\n\nThis reverts commit 257eec43ed795d791a65cb45dd833f4ed645de4b.\n\n* Fix call to checkCSRFToken\n\n* Adapt test that relied on strict CSRF enforcement\n\nThis test was added after\nhttps://github.com/mattermost/mattermost/pull/33444, so it assumed\nstrict CSRF enforcement to be enabled. When reverting that PR, we need\nto adapt the test to account for both cases.\n\n* Fix newer tests to use older setting\n\n(cherry picked from commit d3eb6cbf1cebef4f8a2a9972b6e33fd031e37c5e)\n\nCo-authored-by: Alejandro García Montoro <alejandro.garciamontoro@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJo6VKsCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXA0QAGqrR/M36TCDImSzPauoSXXV\nxhd1Yj54TVC3ZPYMFyYO7OrRq9eDVnK0YpzmsTsZcQShuZFoigugrSqSrVi7LnrX\nnNiU7jYIrpxBJY3vVdd8Vf6iMgORyU83XYOWs0FCwvt9v5C2QNonVA2wXCltynYJ\nJVD1bsZUwowhc/1RRAybsR9+bqZDCwHMio6qKXAmSWR93sOBj3ADVmWNG7btwdbA\npSTOjaMC5OMF+xBizSUnfxhYg7SgN/+AsHp+Oem0RAEngxkUohfLEtyA7YpT