9T02:30:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix OnBoardingTaskList appearing during organization setup flow (#33961) (#33996)\n\nHide the \"Welcome to Mattermost\" onboarding task list when users are on\nthe `/preparing-workspace` route to prevent conflicting UI during the\n\"What''s the name of your organization\" flow.\n\nThis fixes a regression introduced in MM-64380 where the removal of\ntheme-based conditional rendering caused OnBoardingTaskList to appear\non all logged-in routes, including the preparing-workspace flow where\nit conflicts with the organization setup screen.\n\nThe fix adds route-based conditional rendering to restore the original\nintended behavior while maintaining the simplified component structure.\n\nFixes MM-65812\n\n(cherry picked from commit 9a61760bcb52e02da3de2fcf5e36dff78027382c)\n\nCo-authored-by: Jesse Hallam <jesse.hallam@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"48f9a0bd07eab22894f9b7f4943bf3a193e5c01a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ethancroissants/mostlymatter/git/trees/48f9a0bd07eab22894f9b7f4943bf3a193e5c01a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ethancroissants/mostlymatter/git/commits/d90bb094b04d4e6299c6a476c485e302663bc3c2","verification":{"payload":"tree 48f9a0bd07eab22894f9b7f4943bf3a193e5c01a\nparent ea5128a8186fd06ad0414795c86e531f5d8f4b1d\nauthor Mattermost Build <build@mattermost.com> 1759113042 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1759113042 +0000\n\nFix OnBoardingTaskList appearing during organization setup flow (#33961) (#33996)\n\nHide the \"Welcome to Mattermost\" onboarding task list when users are on\nthe `/preparing-workspace` route to prevent conflicting UI during the\n\"What''s the name of your organization\" flow.\n\nThis fixes a regression introduced in MM-64380 where the removal of\ntheme-based conditional rendering caused OnBoardingTaskList to appear\non all logged-in routes, including the preparing-workspace flow where\nit conflicts with the organization setup screen.\n\nThe fix 