7a7eac28a46edbe9eb44aa1f63ea"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/e934890eac7d3b1bf3258e5f7f6ac3501453f32b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-11T18:50:12Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-11T18:50:12Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Clarify shared-infra output → tfvars variable mapping in deployment guide\n\nThe \"note the outputs\" step didn''t make it clear that shared-infrastructure\noutputs (e.g., vpc_id) map to shared_* prefixed variables in the app''s\nterraform.tfvars. Add an explicit mapping table between the two.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0484ddbe05f84f04c9ec420be3b3af1de0c8d9f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/0484ddbe05f84f04c9ec420be3b3af1de0c8d9f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/e934890eac7d3b1bf3258e5f7f6ac3501453f32b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/e934890eac7d3b1bf3258e5f7f6ac3501453f32b","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKGU5MzQ4OTBlYWM3ZDNiMWJmMzI1OGU1ZjdmNmFjMzUwMTQ1M2YzMmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/bc1faab49d696f2aca0f35924ca8dc84bd066205","sha":"bc1faab49d696f2aca0f35924ca8dc84bd066205","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/bc1faab49d696f2aca0f35924ca8dc84bd066205"}],"sha":"e934890eac7d3b1bf3258e5f7f6ac3501453f32b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/e934890eac7d3b1bf3258e5f7f6ac3501453f32b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/bc1faab49d696f2aca0f35924ca8dc84bd066205/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-11T18:38:07Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-11T18:38:07Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Restructure README with deployment and customization guides\n\nReorganize the README to flow: overview → deploy → customize → dev reference,\nmatching the integration-platform README pattern.\n\nNew sections:\n- Why This Project: positioning as companion to integration-platform\n- Architecture Overview: layer diagram, key tables, export/import flow summaries\n- Deployment Guide: 5-step walkthrough (shared-infra → deploy → init DB → secrets → verify)\n- Customization Guide: replace entity handlers, add entities, enable JWT, storage/queue adapters\n\nMove export filter DSL reference to docs/EXPORT_FILTER_DSL.md.\n\nCondense API Reference to endpoint summary table + presigned URL flow + filter\nexample. Fold Security and Architecture sections into new guides.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dd5aa703834cc19c48ab55677c252870c0891afd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/dd5aa703834cc19c48ab55677c252870c0891afd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/bc1faab49d696f2aca0f35924ca8dc84bd066205","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/bc1faab49d696f2aca0f35924ca8dc84bd066205","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKGJjMWZhYWI0OWQ2OTZmMmFjYTBmMzU5MjRjYThkYzg0YmQwNjYyMDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/9ac82689d81deccbc51d600616a9316963873e74","sha":"9ac82689d81deccbc51d600616a9316963873e74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/im