7916f6b37184a01/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-10T17:33:44Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-10T17:33:44Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Parameterize cloud provider in Dockerfile for multi-cloud support\n\nAdd CLOUD_EXTRAS build arg (default: aws) so the same Dockerfile\nworks for Azure and GCP deployments. Build with:\n  --build-arg CLOUD_EXTRAS=azure\n  --build-arg CLOUD_EXTRAS=gcp\n  --build-arg CLOUD_EXTRAS=cloud  (all providers)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d58b62d8c8abd9977d09611bc22492ef07a2824c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/d58b62d8c8abd9977d09611bc22492ef07a2824c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/36a5a335286e4730dcccb0d697916f6b37184a01","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/36a5a335286e4730dcccb0d697916f6b37184a01","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKDM2YTVhMzM1Mjg2ZTQ3MzBkY2NjYjBkNjk3OTE2ZjZiMzcxODRhMDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/cc825982b4b59c51f68f31d93775140ac2ad4d4b","sha":"cc825982b4b59c51f68f31d93775140ac2ad4d4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/cc825982b4b59c51f68f31d93775140ac2ad4d4b"}],"sha":"36a5a335286e4730dcccb0d697916f6b37184a01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/36a5a335286e4730dcccb0d697916f6b37184a01"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/cc825982b4b59c51f68f31d93775140ac2ad4d4b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-12T00:29:05Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-12T00:29:05Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"docs: add manual Docker build instructions for Apple Silicon\n\nDocument the requirement to use --platform linux/amd64 and --no-cache\nwhen building Docker images locally on Mac for AWS Fargate deployment.\nAlso update cluster/service names to match actual deployed names.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"05723af350dc053bc1bcd17be2adbeda2677b00a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/05723af350dc053bc1bcd17be2adbeda2677b00a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/cc825982b4b59c51f68f31d93775140ac2ad4d4b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/cc825982b4b59c51f68f31d93775140ac2ad4d4b","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKGNjODI1OTgyYjRiNTljNTFmNjhmMzFkOTM3NzUxNDBhYzJhZDRkNGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/a90e78778d8c8586315fb12fa8b3dc5ec8d7f6a6","sha":"a90e78778d8c8586315fb12fa8b3dc5ec8d7f6a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/a90e78778d8c8586315fb12fa8b3dc5ec8d7f6a6"}],"sha":"cc825982b4b59c51f68f31d93775140ac2ad4d4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/cc825982b4b59c51f68f31d93775140ac2ad4d4b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/a90e78778d8c8586315fb12fa8b3dc5ec8d7f6a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-11T23:18:05Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-11T23:18:16Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"fix: reduce queue visibility timeout and add granular logging\n\n- Reduce SQS/Azure visibility timeout from 300s to 60s for faster retries\n- Add extend_message_visibility to queue interface and all implementations\n- Add visibility extension background task for long-running jobs\n- Add granular logging in job_runner to trace message receipt and processing\n- Add config settings for visibility_timeout and visibility_extension\n\nThis addresses the 5-minute delay issue where failed jobs weren''t retried\nquickly enough due to the long visibility timeout.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"51ccec541dbd6d7bb4227439a7a42f8347062ddf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/51ccec541dbd6d7bb4227439a7a42f8347062ddf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/a90e78778d8c8586315fb12fa8b3dc5ec8d7f6a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/a90e78778d8c8586315fb12fa8b3dc5ec8d7f6a6","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKGE5MGU3ODc3OGQ4Yzg1ODYzMTVmYjEyZmE4YjNkYzVlYzhkN2Y2YTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/f45a325492c90e8825d36e654e7d2ffd621a6916","sha":"f45a325492c90e8825d36e654e7d2ffd621a6916","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/f45a325492c90e8825d36e654e7d2ffd621a6916"}],"sha":"a90e78778d8c8586315fb12fa8b3dc5ec8d7f6a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/a90e78778d8c8586315fb12fa8b3dc5ec8d7f6a6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/f45a325492c90e8825d36e654e7d2ffd621a6916/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-11T20:14:17Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-11T20:14:17Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Fix bill import to resolve vendor/project by external_id\n\nThe bill handler now looks up vendors and projects by their external_id\nwhen importing, not just by UUID. This allows CSV imports to use\nvendor_external_id and project_external_id columns to link relationships.\n\nAdded _resolve_vendor_id() and _resolve_project_id() helper methods\nthat check for: direct UUID, nested object with id, or external_id lookup.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6b5ae9af05c4791762878d921a1a4fce9c797ce5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/6b5ae9af05c4791762878d921a1a4fce9c797ce5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/f45a325492c90e8825d36e654e7d2ffd621a6916","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/f45a325492c90e8825d36e654e7d2ffd621a6916","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKGY0NWEzMjU0OTJjOTBlODgyNWQzNmU2NTRlN2QyZmZkNjIxYTY5MTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/a7fd9c045685f8b9732f6c4635cf8a371432a55b","sha":"a7fd9c045685f8b9732f6c4635cf8a371432a55b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/a7fd9c045685f8b9732f6c4635cf8a371432a55b"}],"sha":"f45a325492c90e8825d36e654e7d2ffd621a6916","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/f45a325492c90e8825d36e654e7d2ffd621a6916"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/a7fd9c045685f8b9732f6c4635cf8a371432a55b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-11T17:16:44Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-11T17:16:44Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Fix SQL injection validation false positives\n\nRemove overly broad SQL patterns (union, select, exec) that flagged\nlegitimate business names like \"Union Bank\" or \"Select Staffing\".\n\nKeep only unambiguous injection markers ('';, --, /*, */, xp_, sp_).\nReal SQL injection protection comes from parameterized queries via\nSQLAlchemy ORM, not input validation blocklists.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7d7d92e4819212829c42f246303c00ca1885b61f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/7d7d92e4819212829c42f246303c00ca1885b61f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/a7fd9c045685f8b9732f6c4635cf8a371432a55b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/a7fd9c045685f8b9732f6c4635cf8a371432a55b","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKGE3ZmQ5YzA0NTY4NWY4Yjk3MzJmNmM0NjM1Y2Y4YTM3MTQzMmE1NWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/61dc55d7aa34c6db4686937d061a73546d548d84","sha":"61dc55d7aa34c6db4686937d061a73546d548d84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/61dc55d7aa34c6db4686937d061a73546d548d84"}],"sha":"a7fd9c045685f8b9732f6c4635cf8a371432a55b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/a7fd9c045685f8b9732f6c4635cf8a371432a55b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/61dc55d7aa34c6db4686937d061a73546d548d84/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-11T17:11:52Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-11T17:11:52Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Add custom validators to entity registry for import validation\n\nAllow entities to define custom validation functions that run during\nimport validation. Validators receive row data and append errors to a\nmutable list, enabling business-rule validation beyond built-in checks.\n\nAdded example validators to bill entity: amount must be positive, and\ndue_date cannot be before bill date.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b43a8627b0b64c9adf62a817d8cc2489ce7a9515","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/b43a8627b0b64c9adf62a817d8cc2489ce7a9515"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/61dc55d7aa34c6db4686937d061a73546d548d84","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/61dc55d7aa34c6db4686937d061a73546d548d84","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKDYxZGM1NWQ3YWEzNGM2ZGI0Njg2OTM3ZDA2MWE3MzU0NmQ1NDhkODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/160b9e9a6b30bae7270532627c0cd9afcff5b83a","sha":"160b9e9a6b30bae7270532627c0cd9afcff5b83a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/160b9e9a6b30bae7270532627c0cd9afcff5b83a"}],"sha":"61dc55d7aa34c6db4686937d061a73546d548d84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/61dc55d7aa34c6db4686937d061a73546d548d84"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/160b9e9a6b30bae7270532627c0cd9afcff5b83a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-10T20:02:13Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-10T20:02:13Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Refactor terraform to use shared infrastructure pattern\n\n- Remove VPC, RDS, and standalone ECR/IAM resources (now in shared-infrastructure)\n- Add shared_* variables to reference shared infrastructure outputs\n- Fix SQS IAM policy to include sqs:GetQueueUrl permission\n- Use data source for GitHub OIDC provider (already exists account-wide)\n- Update bootstrap for new naming convention\n- Add scripts/init-database.sql for DBA database initialization\n- Update documentation with shared infrastructure deployment steps\n- Clean up obsolete backup files and terraform plan artifacts\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f4b19573dcdb3db1ba003caabd88676875eec229","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/f4b19573dcdb3db1ba003caabd88676875eec229"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/160b9e9a6b30bae7270532627c0cd9afcff5b83a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/160b9e9a6b30bae7270532627c0cd9afcff5b83a","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKDE2MGI5ZTlhNmIzMGJhZTcyNzA1MzI2MjdjMGNkOWFmY2ZmNWI4M2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/bdf61231ff6d5de5074038ef92fabc4e47799fe6","sha":"bdf61231ff6d5de5074038ef92fabc4e47799fe6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/bdf61231ff6d5de5074038ef92fabc4e47799fe6"}],"sha":"160b9e9a6b30bae7270532627c0cd9afcff5b83a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/160b9e9a6b30bae7270532627c0cd9afcff5b83a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/bdf61231ff6d5de5074038ef92fabc4e47799fe6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-06T23:35:48Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-06T23:35:48Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Fix alembic migrations for URL-encoded passwords\n\n- Bypass ConfigParser interpolation by using URL directly with create_engine()\n- Make database_password optional in terraform for shared infra mode\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"992fe6add857b5e4bc5e873dca5426ea4bffc2dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/992fe6add857b5e4bc5e873dca5426ea4bffc2dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/bdf61231ff6d5de5074038ef92fabc4e47799fe6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/bdf61231ff6d5de5074038ef92fabc4e47799fe6","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKGJkZjYxMjMxZmY2ZDVkZTUwNzQwMzhlZjkyZmFiYzRlNDc3OTlmZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/7b89ae5d8a64f6e49f1bdc5a41ebfe2f1f5cae8c","sha":"7b89ae5d8a64f6e49f1bdc5a41ebfe2f1f5cae8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/7b89ae5d8a64f6e49f1bdc5a41ebfe2f1f5cae8c"}],"sha":"bdf61231ff6d5de5074038ef92fabc4e47799fe6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/bdf61231ff6d5de5074038ef92fabc4e47799fe6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/7b89ae5d8a64f6e49f1bdc5a41ebfe2f1f5cae8c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-06T20:49:35Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-06T20:49:35Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Remove terraform-destroy workflow - too dangerous for CI/CD\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a97c82785ec79ebe35f7713d9768acbddefadd61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/a97c82785ec79ebe35f7713d9768acbddefadd61"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/7b89ae5d8a64f6e49f1bdc5a41ebfe2f1f5cae8c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/7b89ae5d8a64f6e49f1bdc5a41ebfe2f1f5cae8c","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKDdiODlhZTVkOGE2NGY2ZTQ5ZjFiZGM1YTQxZWJmZTJmMWY1Y2FlOGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/4a327bc2b80735641a0fa91f6ab3851cf900e727","sha":"4a327bc2b80735641a0fa91f6ab3851cf900e727","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/4a327bc2b80735641a0fa91f6ab3851cf900e727"}],"sha":"7b89ae5d8a64f6e49f1bdc5a41ebfe2f1f5cae8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/7b89ae5d8a64f6e49f1bdc5a41ebfe2f1f5cae8c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/4a327bc2b80735641a0fa91f6ab3851cf900e727/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-06T18:51:17Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-06T18:51:17Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Add shared infrastructure mode for multi-project deployments\n\n- Add use_shared_infra toggle and shared_* variables\n- Create locals.tf for conditional resource resolution\n- Add count conditionals to VPC, security groups, ECS cluster, RDS\n- Update all resource references to use locals\n- Add terraform-destroy.yml workflow for CI/CD\n- Add SHARED_INFRA.md documentation\n- Add shared_infra_tfvars output for easy config sharing\n\nThis enables cost-effective deployments where import-export-orchestrator\nand integration-platform can share VPC, ECS cluster, and RDS.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cd909e74dbfa71b5aaec236aae81604cecb14141","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/cd909e74dbfa71b5aaec236aae81604cecb14141"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/4a327bc2b80735641a0fa91f6ab3851cf900e727","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/4a327bc2b80735641a0fa91f6ab3851cf900e727","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKDRhMzI3YmMyYjgwNzM1NjQxYTBmYTkxZjZhYjM4NTFjZjkwMGU3Mjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/0518292a85be4d55f4a02f201e4dd793c07833e8","sha":"0518292a85be4d55f4a02f201e4dd793c07833e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/0518292a85be4d55f4a02f201e4dd793c07833e8"}],"sha":"4a327bc2b80735641a0fa91f6ab3851cf900e727","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/4a327bc2b80735641a0fa91f6ab3851cf900e727"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/0518292a85be4d55f4a02f201e4dd793c07833e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-04T19:55:44Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-04T19:55:44Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Document naive UTC datetime convention and ECS deployment known issue\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fc5f06db473c9ae59aeb0d75de0b5cf3862a1556","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/fc5f06db473c9ae59aeb0d75de0b5cf3862a1556"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/0518292a85be4d55f4a02f201e4dd793c07833e8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/0518292a85be4d55f4a02f201e4dd793c07833e8","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKDA1MTgyOTJhODViZTRkNTVmNGEwMmYyMDFlNGRkNzkzYzA3ODMzZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/8960e42c8521ac6585a9e3e65a001511f74a9092","sha":"8960e42c8521ac6585a9e3e65a001511f74a9092","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/8960e42c8521ac6585a9e3e65a001511f74a9092"}],"sha":"0518292a85be4d55f4a02f201e4dd793c07833e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/0518292a85be4d55f4a02f201e4dd793c07833e8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/8960e42c8521ac6585a9e3e65a001511f74a9092/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-04T19:22:49Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-04T19:22:49Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Fix timezone mismatch in relative date filters and add S3 CORS config\n\nresolve_relative_date() returned timezone-aware datetimes but DB columns\nare TIMESTAMP WITHOUT TIME ZONE, causing asyncpg to reject the comparison.\nStrip tzinfo to produce naive UTC datetimes matching the DB convention.\nAlso add S3 CORS configuration for presigned URL browser uploads and\nremove unused getAuthTokenHeader from UI client.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a5e592f09fb5c158673226323b3d919871c3ac81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/a5e592f09fb5c158673226323b3d919871c3ac81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/8960e42c8521ac6585a9e3e65a001511f74a9092","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/8960e42c8521ac6585a9e3e65a001511f74a9092","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKDg5NjBlNDJjODUyMWFjNjU4NWE5ZTNlNjVhMDAxNTExZjc0YTkwOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/188d71173bd48b6c49c4df726c901ebbcfbaaee0","sha":"188d71173bd48b6c49c4df726c901ebbcfbaaee0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/188d71173bd48b6c49c4df726c901ebbcfbaaee0"}],"sha":"8960e42c8521ac6585a9e3e65a001511f74a9092","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/8960e42c8521ac6585a9e3e65a001511f74a9092"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/188d71173bd48b6c49c4df726c901ebbcfbaaee0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-03T22:32:09Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-03T22:32:09Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Replace multipart upload with presigned URL import flow\n\nReplace POST /imports/upload (multipart, bounded by API Gateway 10MB limit)\nwith a presigned URL flow: request-upload → direct PUT to cloud → confirm-upload.\nThis lets clients upload files of any size directly to S3/Azure/GCP.\n\n- Add generate_presigned_upload_url() and file_exists() to storage interface\n  with implementations for S3, Azure Blob, and GCP Cloud Storage\n- Add POST /imports/request-upload and POST /imports/confirm-upload endpoints\n- Remove old POST /imports/upload endpoint (no clients using it)\n- Fix /tmp file cleanup bugs in job_runner.py for both export and import paths\n  using uploaded_to_cloud/downloaded_temp_file flags with try/finally blocks\n- Update frontend apiClient to use 3-step presigned flow behind same function\n- Add unit tests for new endpoints (tenant isolation, validation, error cases)\n- Update README.md, CLAUDE.md, and example scripts to reflect new flow\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a28075dfe0f6b7f62a359d1ca0be1ed77c26e9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/9a28075dfe0f6b7f62a359d1ca0be1ed77c26e9e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/188d71173bd48b6c49c4df726c901ebbcfbaaee0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/188d71173bd48b6c49c4df726c901ebbcfbaaee0","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKDE4OGQ3MTE3M2JkNDhiNmM0OWM0ZGY3MjZjOTAxZWJiY2ZiYWFlZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/2adce9e99e4af6c60266190a31644a23d3c84d62","sha":"2adce9e99e4af6c60266190a31644a23d3c84d62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/2adce9e99e4af6c60266190a31644a23d3c84d62"}],"sha":"188d71173bd48b6c49c4df726c901ebbcfbaaee0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/188d71173bd48b6c49c4df726c901ebbcfbaaee0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/2adce9e99e4af6c60266190a31644a23d3c84d62/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-03T21:28:02Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-03T21:28:02Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Add streaming import pipeline with validation and error files\n\n- FileParser: add parse_csv_streaming() generator yielding row batches\n- ImportValidator: add validate_csv_content_streaming() writing errors\n  to JSONL file on disk instead of accumulating in memory\n- JobRunner: add _stream_import_csv() with two-phase flow:\n  Phase 1: stream-validate CSV, upload error JSONL to S3 on failure\n  Phase 2: stream-import in batches with progress tracking via\n  job_statistics, write import errors to JSONL and upload to S3\n- Add Alembic migration for job_statistics JSONB column on job_runs\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"969ef94c869d4a16e54a801c7b7c55065d5ed16e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/969ef94c869d4a16e54a801c7b7c55065d5ed16e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/2adce9e99e4af6c60266190a31644a23d3c84d62","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/2adce9e99e4af6c60266190a31644a23d3c84d62","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKDJhZGNlOWU5OWU0YWY2YzYwMjY2MTkwYTMxNjQ0YTIzZDNjODRkNjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/174cff01be85a2df6e963e16ed394270656b6662","sha":"174cff01be85a2df6e963e16ed394270656b6662","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/174cff01be85a2df6e963e16ed394270656b6662"}],"sha":"2adce9e99e4af6c60266190a31644a23d3c84d62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/2adce9e99e4af6c60266190a31644a23d3c84d62"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/174cff01be85a2df6e963e16ed394270656b6662/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-03T21:00:31Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-03T21:00:31Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Add job_statistics column for live export progress tracking\n\nAdd a JSONB job_statistics column to job_runs that gets updated\nduring streaming exports so the UI can poll for progress. The first\nbatch always writes, intermediate batches only write if 5+ seconds\nhave elapsed since the last update, and the final batch always\nwrites. This keeps DB writes minimal while giving the UI enough\nresolution for a smooth progress bar.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"35e884cb2437ec931d895d97398db4b23b14f208","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/35e884cb2437ec931d895d97398db4b23b14f208"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/174cff01be85a2df6e963e16ed394270656b6662","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/174cff01be85a2df6e963e16ed394270656b6662","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKDE3NGNmZjAxYmU4NWEyZGY2ZTk2M2UxNmVkMzk0MjcwNjU2YjY2NjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/9b80c41d5c77f40bcdc164d4b5d9242f5c20a4d4","sha":"9b80c41d5c77f40bcdc164d4b5d9242f5c20a4d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/9b80c41d5c77f40bcdc164d4b5d9242f5c20a4d4"}],"sha":"174cff01be85a2df6e963e16ed394270656b6662","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/174cff01be85a2df6e963e16ed394270656b6662"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/9b80c41d5c77f40bcdc164d4b5d9242f5c20a4d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-03T20:24:25Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-03T20:24:25Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Fix export/import pipeline: streaming SQL pushdown and batched commits\n\nPush WHERE, ORDER BY, LIMIT/OFFSET into SQL queries instead of\nfiltering in Python. Fix N+1 queries in bill/invoice handlers with\nselectinload. Stream DB results in batches to CSV incrementally so\nrecords never accumulate in memory. Batch import commits every 100\nrecords instead of one giant transaction. Raise export cap from\n10,000 to 100,000.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6852449ecd3f504cd219320509c75d7a16470916","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/6852449ecd3f504cd219320509c75d7a16470916"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/9b80c41d5c77f40bcdc164d4b5d9242f5c20a4d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/9b80c41d5c77f40bcdc164d4b5d9242f5c20a4d4","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKDliODBjNDFkNWM3N2Y0MGJjZGMxNjRkNGI1ZDkyNDJmNWMyMGE0ZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/a58bac988a47bf3879760213a233c2c2689fb859","sha":"a58bac988a47bf3879760213a233c2c2689fb859","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/a58bac988a47bf3879760213a233c2c2689fb859"}],"sha":"9b80c41d5c77f40bcdc164d4b5d9242f5c20a4d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/9b80c41d5c77f40bcdc164d4b5d9242f5c20a4d4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/a58bac988a47bf3879760213a233c2c2689fb859/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-02T18:24:50Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-02T18:24:50Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Simplify CI/CD S3 permissions to s3:* to avoid IAM action name mismatches\n\nTerraform requires both s3:GetBucketX and s3:GetX forms for bucket\noperations. Enumerating them individually caused repeated deploy failures.\nThe CI/CD role already has full IAM/EC2 management so granular S3\npermissions provided no additional security boundary.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"af6fafee3eeb4bb4ffa65b7b80c1043b60bc03c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/af6fafee3eeb4bb4ffa65b7b80c1043b60bc03c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/a58bac988a47bf3879760213a233c2c2689fb859","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/a58bac988a47bf3879760213a233c2c2689fb859","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKGE1OGJhYzk4OGE0N2JmMzg3OTc2MDIxM2EyMzNjMmMyNjg5ZmI4NTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/ca22c651e022a7ec78de3535c677a84476f2e2dc","sha":"ca22c651e022a7ec78de3535c677a84476f2e2dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/ca22c651e022a7ec78de3535c677a84476f2e2dc"}],"sha":"a58bac988a47bf3879760213a233c2c2689fb859","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/a58bac988a47bf3879760213a233c2c2689fb859"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/ca22c651e022a7ec78de3535c677a84476f2e2dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-02T18:16:31Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-02T18:16:31Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Add missing S3 and Secrets Manager permissions to CI/CD IAM policy\n\nAdds s3:GetAccelerateConfiguration and secretsmanager:GetResourcePolicy\nthat Terraform needs when reading state of existing resources.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"443d7bc7b796a5fbc720d6b26af7777452ccc268","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/443d7bc7b796a5fbc720d6b26af7777452ccc268"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/ca22c651e022a7ec78de3535c677a84476f2e2dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/ca22c651e022a7ec78de3535c677a84476f2e2dc","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKGNhMjJjNjUxZTAyMmE3ZWM3OGRlMzUzNWM2NzdhODQ0NzZmMmUyZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/d22a1bf9ed75b38e7992241365a26525df086581","sha":"d22a1bf9ed75b38e7992241365a26525df086581","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/d22a1bf9ed75b38e7992241365a26525df086581"}],"sha":"ca22c651e022a7ec78de3535c677a84476f2e2dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/ca22c651e022a7ec78de3535c677a84476f2e2dc"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/d22a1bf9ed75b38e7992241365a26525df086581/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-30T22:57:25Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-30T22:57:25Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Fix CI/CD: add CloudFront permissions and update repo reference to saasdog-ai\n\nDeploy workflow broke after repo transfer from rajivskumar to saasdog-ai\n(OIDC trust policy mismatch) and was already missing CloudFront permissions\nneeded by ui.tf resources since Jan 22.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a0dd4464840f2417aa7b3b7e4b0cd9c6f8f461d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/a0dd4464840f2417aa7b3b7e4b0cd9c6f8f461d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/d22a1bf9ed75b38e7992241365a26525df086581","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/d22a1bf9ed75b38e7992241365a26525df086581","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKGQyMmExYmY5ZWQ3NWIzOGU3OTkyMjQxMzY1YTI2NTI1ZGYwODY1ODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/32a701c28e451f62416110c40d67ea18d74dd7c4","sha":"32a701c28e451f62416110c40d67ea18d74dd7c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/32a701c28e451f62416110c40d67ea18d74dd7c4"}],"sha":"d22a1bf9ed75b38e7992241365a26525df086581","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/d22a1bf9ed75b38e7992241365a26525df086581"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/32a701c28e451f62416110c40d67ea18d74dd7c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-30T20:36:14Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-30T20:36:14Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Inject DATABASE_URL from Secrets Manager instead of plaintext env var\n\nMove DATABASE_URL from the ECS task definition environment block to the\nsecrets block, so the password is fetched from Secrets Manager at\ncontainer start and never appears in the task definition. The execution\nrole gets a scoped secretsmanager:GetSecretValue policy for the secret\nARN. Store the full connection string (not just the password) since it\ncontains the RDS endpoint resolved at apply time.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a87655d920870bfd6fabe3df395e1bffbeba5878","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/a87655d920870bfd6fabe3df395e1bffbeba5878"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/32a701c28e451f62416110c40d67ea18d74dd7c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/32a701c28e451f62416110c40d67ea18d74dd7c4","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKDMyYTcwMWMyOGU0NTFmNjI0MTYxMTBjNDBkNjdlYTE4ZDc0ZGQ3YzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/a5d36dbfb1497472b62685193e447262c9bbc60b","sha":"a5d36dbfb1497472b62685193e447262c9bbc60b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/a5d36dbfb1497472b62685193e447262c9bbc60b"}],"sha":"32a701c28e451f62416110c40d67ea18d74dd7c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/32a701c28e451f62416110c40d67ea18d74dd7c4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/a5d36dbfb1497472b62685193e447262c9bbc60b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-30T20:13:12Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-30T20:13:12Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Entity registry, handler split, infra hardening, and docs consolidation\n\nP1: Centralize entity metadata into a registry pattern (app/entities/)\nso adding a new entity requires 2 files + 1 enum entry instead of\n14 edits across 6 files. Consumers (schema, query, validator) now\nauto-generate from the registry.\n\nP2: Extract generic import orchestration into BaseSaaSApiClient with\nper-entity handlers (app/infrastructure/saas/handlers/), reducing\nclient.py from ~997 lines to ~72 lines.\n\nP3: Add CLAUDE.md documenting entity onboarding, handler patterns,\ninfrastructure deployment, and testing conventions.\n\nP4: Infrastructure hardening — remove hardcoded AWS account ID from\nCI/CD, parameterize all hardcoded Terraform values, add Secrets Manager\nfor DB password, add conditional HTTPS/TLS on ALB, tighten CI/CD IAM\nwith aws:RequestedRegion condition.\n\nP5: Fix inaccurate docs (wrong endpoints, wrong ALLOWED_ORIGINS default),\nconsolidate duplicates (AWS_DEPLOYMENT + PRODUCTION_CHECKLIST into\nINFRASTRUCTURE_ONBOARDING), add Azure/GCP mapping tables.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e774e0ad9abadc19572d5522ffd757a84ba54e9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/e774e0ad9abadc19572d5522ffd757a84ba54e9f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/a5d36dbfb1497472b62685193e447262c9bbc60b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/a5d36dbfb1497472b62685193e447262c9bbc60b","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKGE1ZDM2ZGJmYjE0OTc0NzJiNjI2ODUxOTNlNDQ3MjYyYzliYmM2MGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/16dd78986ece1f6ccb5a988ac0543bf348295c74","sha":"16dd78986ece1f6ccb5a988ac0543bf348295c74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/16dd78986ece1f6ccb5a988ac0543bf348295c74"}],"sha":"a5d36dbfb1497472b62685193e447262c9bbc60b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/a5d36dbfb1497472b62685193e447262c9bbc60b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/16dd78986ece1f6ccb5a988ac0543bf348295c74/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-23T18:20:45Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-23T18:20:45Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Add unit tests for field aliasing feature in exports\n\n- Add API tests for export creation/preview with field aliases\n- Add domain tests for ExportField model and ExportConfig helpers\n- Add file generator tests for CSV/JSON with aliased headers\n- Add query engine tests for aliased output records\n- Add dev:local script to UI package.json\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f8b0e6676fdfad01c3e0f13ce558cf118a02d9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/0f8b0e6676fdfad01c3e0f13ce558cf118a02d9f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/16dd78986ece1f6ccb5a988ac0543bf348295c74","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/16dd78986ece1f6ccb5a988ac0543bf348295c74","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKDE2ZGQ3ODk4NmVjZTFmNmNjYjVhOTg4YWMwNTQzYmYzNDgyOTVjNzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/731200e8f2272b5e0107d70cefaaee2507549340","sha":"731200e8f2272b5e0107d70cefaaee2507549340","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/731200e8f2272b5e0107d70cefaaee2507549340"}],"sha":"16dd78986ece1f6ccb5a988ac0543bf348295c74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/16dd78986ece1f6ccb5a988ac0543bf348295c74"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/731200e8f2272b5e0107d70cefaaee2507549340/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-22T23:27:25Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-22T23:27:38Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Implement JWT authentication with JWKS support\n\nFeatures:\n- Add JWKS client with caching for asymmetric key validation (RS256/ES256)\n- Support symmetric key validation (HS256) for simpler setups\n- Configurable issuer, audience, and client_id claim validation\n- Auto-refresh JWKS keys when not found in cache\n\nConfiguration:\n- JWT_JWKS_URL: JWKS endpoint for public keys\n- JWT_ISSUER: Expected issuer claim\n- JWT_AUDIENCE: Expected audience claim\n- JWT_CLIENT_ID_CLAIM: Claim name for client ID (default: client_id)\n- JWT_ALGORITHM: RS256 (default), ES256, or HS256\n- JWT_JWKS_CACHE_TTL: Key cache TTL in seconds\n\nTests:\n- 40 comprehensive tests for JWT validation\n- Tests for HS256 token validation\n- Tests for issuer/audience verification\n- Tests for client ID extraction from various claims\n- Tests for JWKS client caching\n\nDocumentation:\n- Added JWT_AUTHENTICATION.md with setup guide\n- Examples for Auth0, Okta, and custom auth providers\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c565ff2b3fc9bcffab8814936de9802f25fcc2ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/c565ff2b3fc9bcffab8814936de9802f25fcc2ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/731200e8f2272b5e0107d70cefaaee2507549340","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/731200e8f2272b5e0107d70cefaaee2507549340","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKDczMTIwMGU4ZjIyNzJiNWUwMTA3ZDcwY2VmYWFlZTI1MDc1NDkzNDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/0a44b6d82bcd2081d953d2bd9444cb5cf1dce7c8","sha":"0a44b6d82bcd2081d953d2bd9444cb5cf1dce7c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/0a44b6d82bcd2081d953d2bd9444cb5cf1dce7c8"}],"sha":"731200e8f2272b5e0107d70cefaaee2507549340","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/731200e8f2272b5e0107d70cefaaee2507549340"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/0a44b6d82bcd2081d953d2bd9444cb5cf1dce7c8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-22T23:04:12Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-22T23:04:12Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Fix terraform formatting\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8b23b71382506fd2d941ed46c52b790e0fc67698","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/8b23b71382506fd2d941ed46c52b790e0fc67698"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/0a44b6d82bcd2081d953d2bd9444cb5cf1dce7c8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/0a44b6d82bcd2081d953d2bd9444cb5cf1dce7c8","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKDBhNDRiNmQ4MmJjZDIwODFkOTUzZDJiZDk0NDRjYjVjZjFkY2U3Yzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/93d2397871881b54c59f7341ba2aeeac26217e51","sha":"93d2397871881b54c59f7341ba2aeeac26217e51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/93d2397871881b54c59f7341ba2aeeac26217e51"}],"sha":"0a44b6d82bcd2081d953d2bd9444cb5cf1dce7c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/0a44b6d82bcd2081d953d2bd9444cb5cf1dce7c8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/93d2397871881b54c59f7341ba2aeeac26217e51/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-22T23:00:13Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-22T23:00:13Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Enable ECS Exec and fix datetime filter UI\n\nInfrastructure:\n- Enable ECS Exec for secure container shell access\n- Add SSM permissions to ECS task role for ECS Exec\n\nUI:\n- Fix date filter to recognize datetime fields (created_at, updated_at)\n- Now shows relative date options and date picker for datetime fields\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"736f45e1e6a21780f6bd14bf5abf86aa91c7b64d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/736f45e1e6a21780f6bd14bf5abf86aa91c7b64d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/93d2397871881b54c59f7341ba2aeeac26217e51","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/93d2397871881b54c59f7341ba2aeeac26217e51","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKDkzZDIzOTc4NzE4ODFiNTRjNTlmNzM0MWJhMmFlZWFjMjYyMTdlNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/256430a7c13e91a1d6290204b794290480084ad7","sha":"256430a7c13e91a1d6290204b794290480084ad7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/256430a7c13e91a1d6290204b794290480084ad7"}],"sha":"93d2397871881b54c59f7341ba2aeeac26217e51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/93d2397871881b54c59f7341ba2