al","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-22T21:18:08Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Reduce CloudWatch log retention to 1 day for dev environment\n\nMinimizes storage costs for development. Production should use\nlonger retention (7-30 days).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2e61080e74086b382ced7bce94183169af09fbb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/2e61080e74086b382ced7bce94183169af09fbb3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/f9d816d40d3c1017738a745532b97eb880327d3c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/f9d816d40d3c1017738a745532b97eb880327d3c","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKGY5ZDgxNmQ0MGQzYzEwMTc3MzhhNzQ1NTMyYjk3ZWI4ODAzMjdkM2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/b878f43bcf533c05ec02ef3538b4b52bc3284b67","sha":"b878f43bcf533c05ec02ef3538b4b52bc3284b67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/b878f43bcf533c05ec02ef3538b4b52bc3284b67"}],"sha":"f9d816d40d3c1017738a745532b97eb880327d3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/f9d816d40d3c1017738a745532b97eb880327d3c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/b878f43bcf533c05ec02ef3538b4b52bc3284b67/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-22T21:12:12Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-22T21:12:12Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Disable ECS Container Insights to stay within CloudWatch free tier\n\nContainer Insights generates custom metrics that count against the\n10 free CloudWatch metrics. Disabled for dev to avoid costs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"89959807bf67b0cbf7eb7f9047938e9d4a88f386","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/89959807bf67b0cbf7eb7f9047938e9d4a88f386"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/b878f43bcf533c05ec02ef3538b4b52bc3284b67","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/b878f43bcf533c05ec02ef3538b4b52bc3284b67","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKGI4NzhmNDNiY2Y1MzNjMDVlYzAyZWYzNTM4YjRiNTJiYzMyODRiNjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/3c1ceeb06e910ff492b22e43195c73d0243b64d7","sha":"3c1ceeb06e910ff492b22e43195c73d0243b64d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/3c1ceeb06e910ff492b22e43195c73d0243b64d7"}],"sha":"b878f43bcf533c05ec02ef3538b4b52bc3284b67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/b878f43bcf533c05ec02ef3538b4b52bc3284b67"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/3c1ceeb06e910ff492b22e43195c73d0243b64d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-22T21:06:31Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-22T21:06:31Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Add S3 + CloudFront UI hosting infrastructure\n\n- Add ui.tf with S3 bucket, website hosting, and CloudFront config\n  (CloudFront commented out pending AWS account verification)\n- Add ALLOWED_ORIGINS to ECS task for CORS support\n- Update ConfigProvider and client.ts to use VITE_API_URL env var\n- Add deploy-ui.sh script for S3 deployment\n- Add vite.config.aws.ts for local development against AWS backend\n- Add dev:aws npm script\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f98b0a05771ff1807f9055654795c0ccbbc5a967","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/f98b0a05771ff1807f9055654795c0ccbbc5a967"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/3c1ceeb06e910ff492b22e43195c73d0243b64d7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/3c1ceeb06e910ff492b22e43195c73d0243b64d7","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKDNjMWNlZWIwNmU5MTBmZjQ5MmIyMmU0MzE5NWM3M2QwMjQzYjY0ZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/062ff9ed76d8764b2c661378d1428025ac42321a","sha":"062ff9ed76d8764b2c661378d1428025ac42321a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/062ff9ed76d8764b2c661378d1428025ac42321a"}],"sha":"3c1ceeb06e910ff492b22e43195c73d0243b64d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/3c1ceeb06e910ff492b22e43195c73d0243b64d7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/062ff9ed76d8764b2c661378d1428025ac42321a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-21T22:54:05Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-21T22:54:39Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Add micro-frontend support, schema improvements, and test data\n\nBackend changes:\n- Add datetime type for created_at/updated_at fields in API schema\n- Add due_date field to Bill and Invoice entities\n- Add updated_at filtering support for all entities\n- Fix date parsing in invoice update method\n- Update query schema tests with comprehensive field coverage\n- Add external_id to seed data for all entities\n\nUI micro-frontend support:\n- Add Module Federation configuration for remote loading\n- Create MicroFrontend component for content-only rendering\n- Add useNavigation hook for cross-module navigation\n- Add CSS variable theming for host app integration\n- Update all navigation to work in micro-frontend context\n\nTest data and documentation:\n- Add comprehensive import test CSV files (test-data/)\n- Remove old samples/ folder\n- Update DATE_FILTERING.md with entity export examples\n- Update .gitignore with backup file patterns\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6adfd8b1893156f476e0cbbaf329809a4041f291","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/6adfd8b1893156f476e0cbbaf329809a4041f291"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/062ff9ed76d8764b2c661378d1428025ac42321a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/062ff9ed76d8764b2c661378d1428025ac42321a","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKDA2MmZmOWVkNzZkODc2NGIyYzY2MTM3OGQxNDI4MDI1YWM0MjMyMWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/eac01edc4c7386a3d316a0b4fa6d5b84a3131ee2","sha":"eac01edc4c7386a3d316a0b4fa6d5b84a3131ee2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/eac01edc4c7386a3d316a0b4fa6d5b84a3131ee2"}],"sha":"062ff9ed76d8764b2c661378d1428025ac42321a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/062ff9ed76d8764b2c661378d1428025ac42321a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/eac01edc4c7386a3d316a0b4fa6d5b84a3131ee2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2