32e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-20T19:46:09Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-20T19:46:09Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Update import test to expect raw exception propagation\n\nGeneric exceptions in execute_import now propagate to the global\nexception handler for secure error message handling, rather than\nbeing caught and converted to HTTPException locally.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1ef1e6ebe44d170e10cf4a8f5070c1357f51c56f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/1ef1e6ebe44d170e10cf4a8f5070c1357f51c56f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/a2082709afcf951e54196fe246a4d003e94e32e4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/a2082709afcf951e54196fe246a4d003e94e32e4","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKGEyMDgyNzA5YWZjZjk1MWU1NDE5NmZlMjQ2YTRkMDAzZTk0ZTMyZTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/67c7a306dba42bd3fa013b4effc6cc93edb444e8","sha":"67c7a306dba42bd3fa013b4effc6cc93edb444e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/67c7a306dba42bd3fa013b4effc6cc93edb444e8"}],"sha":"a2082709afcf951e54196fe246a4d003e94e32e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/a2082709afcf951e54196fe246a4d003e94e32e4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/67c7a306dba42bd3fa013b4effc6cc93edb444e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-20T19:38:06Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-20T19:44:39Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Add security fixes, code quality improvements, and UI test infrastructure\n\nSecurity fixes:\n- Fix CORS default to restrictive localhost-only origins\n- Add security headers middleware (X-Frame-Options, CSP, etc.)\n- Add production validation for CORS origins and auth settings\n- Fix path traversal vulnerability in exports download endpoint\n- Sanitize error messages in health check endpoints\n- Remove sensitive exception disclosure in API error handlers\n- Add rate limiting middleware with configurable limits\n- Create centralized auth module, remove hardcoded dev-token\n- Fix hardcoded client_id in ExportCreate\n\nCode quality improvements:\n- Add toast notification system (replaces alert/confirm)\n- Add Error Boundary component for graceful error handling\n- Extract shared constants (ENTITIES, API config, etc.)\n- Add date formatting utilities (formatDateTime, formatDate, etc.)\n- Update components to use toast notifications\n- Add confirmation dialogs for destructive actions\n\nUI test infrastructure:\n- Add test setup with MSW mock handlers\n- Add test utilities with providers (QueryClient, Router, Toast)\n- Mock auth module for tests\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"13acc2d59c45f2ba66c61d16535907f932aee956","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/13acc2d59c45f2ba66c61d16535907f932aee956"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/67c7a306dba42bd3fa013b4effc6cc93edb444e8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/67c7a306dba42bd3fa013b4effc6cc93edb444e8","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKDY3YzdhMzA2ZGJhNDJiZDNmYTAxM2I0ZWZmYzZjYzkzZWRiNDQ0ZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/c7ea906592da17434d89f71c2c36d9d4db63440c","sha":"c7ea906592da17434d89f71c2c36d9d4db63440c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/c7ea906592da17434d89f71c2c36d9d4db63440c"}],"sha":"67c7a306dba42bd3fa013b4effc6cc93edb444e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/67c7a306dba42bd3fa013b4effc6cc93edb444e8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/c7ea906592da17434d89f71c2c36d9d4db63440c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-16T05:15:46Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-16T05:15:46Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Add logging for field mapping/alias functionality\n\n- Log aliased_count in export request/preview endpoints\n- Add debug logging for field aliases when present\n- Log source_fields and output_fields mappings in job runner\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ea1e06c350d3a83de7a5187f334efbf5c152a64a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/ea1e06c350d3a83de7a5187f334efbf5c152a64a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/c7ea906592da17434d89f71c2c36d9d4db63440c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/c7ea906592da17434d89f71c2c36d9d4db63440c","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKGM3ZWE5MDY1OTJkYTE3NDM0ZDg5ZjcxYzJjMzZkOWQ0ZGI2MzQ0MGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/10d9f065b24c8641cd10f50af7478d08bf709fd8","sha":"10d9f065b24c8641cd10f50af7478d08bf709fd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/10d9f065b24c8641cd10f50af7478d08bf709fd8"}],"sha":"c7ea906592da17434d89f71c2c36d9d4db63440c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/c7ea906592da17434d89f71c2c36d9d4db63440c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/10d9f065b24c8641cd10f50af7478d08bf709fd8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-16T05:10:33Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-16T05:10:33Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Add OpenAPI examples for export field definitions\n\nEnhanced OpenAPI schema with comprehensive examples for code generation:\n- ExportField: examples for field paths and aliases\n- ExportRequest: complete request example with filters and sorting\n- ExportPreviewRequest: simplified preview example\n- Added detailed descriptions for all properties\n\nThis enables better auto-generated client code and API documentation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3d0bd19d54583899841ef8984d89ffe9a780f025","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/3d0bd19d54583899841ef8984d89ffe9a780f025"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/10d9f065b24c8641cd10f50af7478d08bf709fd8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/10d9f065b24c8641cd10f50af7478d08bf709fd8","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKDEwZDlmMDY1YjI0Yzg2NDFjZDEwZjUwYWY3NDc4ZDA4YmY3MDlmZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/dacea9f4f5582bfbf92f8258381fdc3263c9aa66","sha":"dacea9f4f5582bfbf92f8258381fdc3263c9aa66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/dacea9f4f5582bfbf92f8258381fdc3263c9aa66"}],"sha":"10d9f065b24c8641cd10f50af7478d08bf709fd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/10d9f065b24c8641cd10f50af7478d08bf709fd8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/dacea9f4f5582bfbf92f8258381fdc3263c9aa66/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-16T05:08:28Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-16T05:08:28Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Update export documentation with field mapping examples\n\n- Updated all examples to use new field definition format\n- Added comprehensive \"Field Definitions\" section explaining:\n  - Field definition properties (field, as, format)\n  - Simple fields vs fields with aliases\n  - How field order affects output column order\n  - Available fields for each entity\n- Updated quick reference with new syntax\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"22cd3ad729ef1bd5663e2c2f672ff1cd1cef428e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/22cd3ad729ef1bd5663e2c2f672ff1cd1cef428e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/dacea9f4f5582bfbf92f8258381fdc3263c9aa66","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/dacea9f4f5582bfbf92f8258381fdc3263c9aa66","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKGRhY2VhOWY0ZjU1ODJiZmJmOTJmODI1ODM4MWZkYzMyNjNjOWFhNjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/a219e11a625d0bcd50f38daa3392f1b0966ce538","sha":"a219e11a625d0bcd50f38daa3392f1b0966ce538","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/a219e11a625d0bcd50f38daa3392f1b0966ce538"}],"sha":"dacea9f4f5582bfbf92f8258381fdc3263c9aa66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/dacea9f4f5582bfbf92f8258381fdc3263c9aa66"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/a219e11a625d0bcd50f38daa3392f1b0966ce538/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-15T22:38:53Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-15T22:38:53Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Add structured field definitions with alias support for exports\n\nReplace simple `fields: list[str]` with `fields: list[ExportField]` where\nExportField supports:\n- `field`: Source field path (e.g., \"vendor.name\")\n- `as`: Output alias (e.g., \"Vendor Name\")\n- `format`: Reserved for future transformations\n\nField order is determined by array position. Aliases are applied in both\npreview responses and exported files (CSV headers, JSON keys).\n\nExample:\n  fields: [\n    {\"field\": \"id\"},\n    {\"field\": \"amount\", \"as\": \"Total Amount\"},\n    {\"field\": \"vendor.name\", \"as\": \"Vendor Name\"}\n  ]\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ce686bc2a94e34053632a5a6edec62bb1a3abe85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/ce686bc2a94e34053632a5a6edec62bb1a3abe85"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/a219e11a625d0bcd50f38daa3392f1b0966ce538","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/a219e11a625d0bcd50f38daa3392f1b0966ce538","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKGEyMTllMTFhNjI1ZDBiY2Q1MGYzOGRhYTMzOTJmMWIwOTY2Y2U1Mzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/b136b6d11012320d5dd17851be4c1c2fea2a3caf","sha":"b136b6d11012320d5dd17851be4c1c2fea2a3caf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/b136b6d11012320d5dd17851be4c1c2fea2a3caf"}],"sha":"a219e11a625d0bcd50f38daa3392f1b0966ce538","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/a219e11a625d0bcd50f38daa3392f1b0966ce538"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/b136b6d11012320d5dd17851be4c1c2fea2a3caf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-15T18:50:28Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-15T18:50:28Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Fix MockSaaSApiClient fixtures to pass db argument\n\nUpdated tests/conftest.py to pass the test_db to MockSaaSApiClient\nat both fixture locations (lines 147 and 229).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0056b58304d70ab1d421a2f945e525ddb92edfd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/0056b58304d70ab1d421a2f945e525ddb92edfd0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/b136b6d11012320d5dd17851be4c1c2fea2a3caf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/b136b6d11012320d5dd17851be4c1c2fea2a3caf","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKGIxMzZiNmQxMTAxMjMyMGQ1ZGQxNzg1MWJlNGMxYzJmZWEyYTNjYWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/287d94bf998759159f67358b3c76990b77124828","sha":"287d94bf998759159f67358b3c76990b77124828","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/287d94bf998759159f67358b3c76990b77124828"}],"sha":"b136b6d11012320d5dd17851be4c1c2fea2a3caf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/b136b6d11012320d5dd17851be4c1c2fea2a3caf"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/287d94bf998759159f67358b3c76990b77124828/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-15T18:42:33Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-15T18:42:33Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Add sample data models and migration for import/export testing\n\n- Add SampleVendorModel, SampleInvoiceModel, SampleBillModel, and\n  SampleProjectModel to support database-backed mock SaaS client\n- Add Alembic migration 003 to create sample_* tables\n- Update dependency injection to pass database connection to\n  MockSaaSApiClient\n\nThese models are used by the MockSaaSApiClient to simulate a real\nSaaS API while storing data in PostgreSQL for testing purposes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cf5b03069e46902b13cc3113c83083954831ebdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/cf5b03069e46902b13cc3113c83083954831ebdd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/287d94bf998759159f67358b3c76990b77124828","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/287d94bf998759159f67358b3c76990b77124828","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKDI4N2Q5NGJmOTk4NzU5MTU5ZjY3MzU4YjNjNzY5OTBiNzcxMjQ4Mjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/c450474dc0e9437dd2510cdcdc836b251cb4af3c","sha":"c450474dc0e9437dd2510cdcdc836b251cb4af3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/c450474dc0e9437dd2510cdcdc836b251cb4af3c"}],"sha":"287d94bf998759159f67358b3c76990b77124828","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/287d94bf998759159f67358b3c76990b77124828"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/c450474dc0e9437dd2510cdcdc836b251cb4af3c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-15T18:21:39Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-15T18:24:44Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Fix descending sort for numeric fields and update test fixtures\n\n- Remove erroneous all_desc reversal in _apply_sorting that was\n  double-reversing already-correct numeric sorts (the negation logic\n  already handles numeric descending correctly)\n- Update test_query_engine.py and test_query_engine_deep.py fixtures\n  to use AsyncMock with predictable SAMPLE_BILLS data instead of\n  requiring database connection\n- Mark obsolete file-based MockSaaSApiClient tests as skipped with\n  documentation explaining the change to database-backed implementation\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aa83513609f678e75b30743e68374ff905c32242","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/aa83513609f678e75b30743e68374ff905c32242"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/c450474dc0e9437dd2510cdcdc836b251cb4af3c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/c450474dc0e9437dd2510cdcdc836b251cb4af3c","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKGM0NTA0NzRkYzBlOTQzN2RkMjUxMGNkY2RjODM2YjI1MWNiNGFmM2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/b1e00e6279a0e05bdc22f0e9ca114fed1b03f334","sh