on handling in API endpoints for direct function calls\n- Update repository tests to mock db.transaction() instead of async_session_maker()\n- Fix datetime deprecation warnings (replace utcnow() with now(UTC))\n- Fix detailed health check JSON serialization (convert datetime to ISO string)\n- All 145 unit tests now passing\n- Code coverage: 59%","tree":{"sha":"134c54c3a363d6e18f8016e5463285822da69f2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/134c54c3a363d6e18f8016e5463285822da69f2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/ced0470935646396ce8c4830ca71c0cde2fd8536","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/ced0470935646396ce8c4830ca71c0cde2fd8536","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKGNlZDA0NzA5MzU2NDYzOTZjZThjNDgzMGNhNzFjMGNkZTJmZDg1MzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/3e7e71f77ba3fb4c34b7cb89c8c3ce742a4fc414","sha":"3e7e71f77ba3fb4c34b7cb89c8c3ce742a4fc414","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/3e7e71f77ba3fb4c34b7cb89c8c3ce742a4fc414"}],"sha":"ced0470935646396ce8c4830ca71c0cde2fd8536","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/ced0470935646396ce8c4830ca71c0cde2fd8536"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/3e7e71f77ba3fb4c34b7cb89c8c3ce742a4fc414/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-21T19:15:27Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-21T19:15:27Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Fix unit tests and improve exception handling\n\n- Fix 7 failing unit tests by updating mocks and exception handling\n- Add ValueError and Exception handling in API endpoints for better error conversion\n- Update repository tests to mock db.transaction() instead of async_session_maker()\n- Fix datetime deprecation warnings (replace utcnow() with now(UTC))\n- Fix detailed health check endpoint JSON serialization\n- All 145 unit tests now passing\n- Example scripts verified and working","tree":{"sha":"78c903909a15269e16e8705ef695d35abf1865c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/78c903909a15269e16e8705ef695d35abf1865c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/3e7e71f77ba3fb4c34b7cb89c8c3ce742a4fc414","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/3e7e71f77ba3fb4c34b7cb89c8c3ce742a4fc414","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKDNlN2U3MWY3N2JhM2ZiNGMzNGI3Y2I4OWM4YzNjZTc0MmE0ZmM0MTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/8822eb427c263f7e8484e6b864e90fae21c2cbba","sha":"8822eb427c263f7e8484e6b864e90fae21c2cbba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/8822eb427c263f7e8484e6b864e90fae21c2cbba"}],"sha":"3e7e71f77ba3fb4c34b7cb89c8c3ce742a4fc414","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/3e7e71f77ba3fb4c34b7cb89c8c3ce742a4fc414"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/8822eb427c263f7e8484e6b864e90fae21c2cbba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-21T18:18:13Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-21T18:21:25Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Add client_id-based security filtering and reorganize example scripts\n\nSecurity Fixes:\n- Add client_id to all mock data entities (bills, invoices, vendors, projects)\n- Update SaaSApiClientInterface to require client_id parameter\n- Implement client_id filtering in MockSaaSApiClient.fetch_data()\n- Ensure import_data() assigns correct client_id to imported records\n- Update ExportQueryEngine.execute_export_query() to accept and pass client_id\n- Update all API endpoints and job runner to pass client_id\n- Add multi-tenant data isolation (default client + client 2 for testing)\n\nScript Reorganization:\n- Move example/test scripts from root to scripts/examples/\n  - check_job_status.py\n  - run_sample_export.py\n  - test_import.py\n  - test_import_validation.py\n  - test_scheduled_export.py\n- Create scripts/examples/README.md with documentation\n- Create scripts/examples/TEST_RESULTS.md with verification results\n- Update paths in scripts to work from new location\n- Update run_sample_export.py to use default client ID\n\nTest Updates:\n- Update all unit tests to pass client_id parameter\n- Update test_saas_client.py to verify client_id filtering\n- Update test_query_engine.py to pass client_id\n- All tests now verify data isolation by client_id\n\nDocumentation:\n- Update docs/IMPORT_TESTING.md and docs/IMPORT_TEST_RESULTS.md\n- Update .gitignore to reflect script reorganization\n\nThis ensures customers can only export/import their own data, preventing\ncross-client data access vulnerabilities.","tree":{"sha":"3df110872b03e0e9a3415abf9b54ee31c241eab1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/3df110872b03e0e9a3415abf9b54ee31c241eab1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/8822eb427c263f7e8484e6b864e90fae21c2cbba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/8822eb427c263f7e8484e6b864e90fae21c2cbba","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKDg4MjJlYjQyN2MyNjNmN2U4NDg0ZTZiODY0ZTkwZmFlMjFjMmNiYmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/1231f010110c0e86ba059fa6e809a95e621f5c6d","sha":"1231f010110c0e86ba059fa6e809a95e621f5c6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/1231f010110c0e86ba059fa6e809a95e621f5c6d"}],"sha":"8822eb427c263f7e8484e6b864e90fae21c2cbba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/8822eb427c263f7e8484e6b864e90fae21c2cbba"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/1231f010110c0e86ba059fa6e809a95e621f5c6d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-21T15:58:59Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-21T16:02:33Z","email":"rajivkumar@Rajivs-Laptop.local","name":"Rajiv Kumar"},"message":"Add comprehensive logging at all process boundaries\n\n- Add logging to API endpoints (exports, jobs, imports, health)\n  - Log request inputs (client_id, parameters, filters)\n  - Log response outputs (status, counts, IDs)\n  - Log access denied warnings\n\n- Add logging to database repository operations\n  - Log create/update/get operations\n  - Log input parameters (IDs, filters, dates)\n  - Log output results (counts, status)\n\n- Add logging to external service calls\n  - SaaS API: fetch_data, import_data\n  - Cloud Storage: upload, download, presigned URLs (S3, Azure, GCP)\n  - Message Queues: send, receive, delete (SQS, Azure, GCP)\n\n- Add logging to job execution\n  - Log job start/completion with run_id, job_id, status\n  - Log status transitions\n  - Log error details with context\n  - Log result summaries (record counts, file locations)\n\n- All logging excludes PII (emails, phone numbers, addresses, descriptions)\n- Use appropriate log levels (info, debug, warning, error)\n- Total: 184 logging statements added across all process boundaries\n\n- Add OpenAPI client generation documentation\n  - Document available OpenAPI endpoints\n  - Provide code generation examples for multiple languages\n  - Include CI/CD automation examples","tree":{"sha":"3b1cc8f3dc7d6801606b1ba2df114030bdb57286","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/trees/3b1cc8f3dc7d6801606b1ba2df114030bdb57286"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/git/commits/1231f010110c0e86ba059fa6e809a95e621f5c6d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/1231f010110c0e86ba059fa6e809a95e621f5c6d","node_id":"C_kwDOQZ3J3toAKDEyMzFmMDEwMTEwYzBlODZiYTA1OWZhNmU4MDlhOTVlNjIxZjVjNmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commit/db6da992084573f1d5f7c6ef84cbe10d0def96c7","sha":"db6da992084573f1d5f7c6ef84cbe10d0def96c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/db6da992084573f1d5f7c6ef84cbe10d0def96c7"}],"sha":"1231f010110c0e86ba059fa6e809a95e621f5c6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits/1231f010110c0e86ba059fa6e809a95e621f5c6d"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/saasdog-ai/import-export-orchestrator/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=c92fb170c9ee72867499d42c9f6caa864f22036c&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A57%3A00.318Z"}');
