 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA","tree":{"sha":"0bcc7e4082c459b9994ca2a4e20266fbadada0e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/trees/0bcc7e4082c459b9994ca2a4e20266fbadada0e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/commits/bc5eeb05bf02746ac0c8fdfe1815a2f2dec1c40b","verification":{"payload":"tree 0bcc7e4082c459b9994ca2a4e20266fbadada0e5\nparent 5f67760a31dda7a47ee5e93ce0b9d7a7a8e9d9ac\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791293862 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791293862 +0000\n\nmeta-matrix: run the built CLI by default\n\nThe plugin host redirects vite/rollup imports to its compiled shims\n(dist/plugin-host/*.js); from src/cli.ts via tsx those files do not exist\nand Vite-based frameworks failed with ENOENT shim.js. LUNX_CLI still\noverrides; src/cli.ts is used only when dist/ is missing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGNVPTiM\n6kFw02WiyD1oQf3/PXN5ReRipXdEBlfkGWHwQozKACB5ymhMATTmSuM7xZPx5Ht8tM4wHt1eRi62\nPwA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T13:37:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_ur