omment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T13:08:36Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Fix Production Gate E2E failures\n\n- Restore core/cache-manager and nuxt/auto-imports-bridge: the e2e\n  fixtures (pb-06, nuxt-saas-platform) import them.\n- Meta-frameworks whose CLI is not installed fall back to lunx''s built-in\n  support again, also on the plugin-host path (NUXT-05).\n- preset ssr builds the browser half only when there is a page\n  (index.html or an .html entry); server-rendered projects without one\n  failed with \"Entry not found: index.html\" (qwikcity, astro, remix).\n- solidstart-dashboard: client entry imported ./app/routes from src/,\n  where app/ is not; Rolldown rejects the unresolved import.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA","tree":{"sha":"5cced5b4adc1bbaec2a3e88a2940cb75316e2cc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/trees/5cced5b4adc1bbaec2a3e88a2940cb75316e2cc9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/commits/d957fdc40f9a666415b1ef686c6263d4744e5895","verification":{"payload":"tree 5cced5b4adc1bbaec2a3e88a2940cb75316e2cc9\nparent 3d6da6042c7af417f292cec87484f5caa3355d4a\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791292116 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791292116 +0000\n\nFix Production Gate E2E failures\n\n- Restore core/cache-manager and nuxt/auto-imports-bridge: the e2e\n  fixtures (pb-06, nuxt-saas-platform) import them.\n- Meta-frameworks whose CLI is not installed fall back to lunx''s built-in\n  support again, also on the plugin-host path (NUXT-05).\n- preset ssr builds the browser half only when there is a page\n  (index.html or an .html entry); server-rendered projects without one\n  failed with \"Entry not found: index.html\" (qwikcity, astro, remix).\n- solidstart-dashboard: client entry imported ./app/routes from src/,\n  where app/ is not; Rolldown rejects the unresolved import.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQE99HQpT\nAVqzjcHeDnFF/8SA2L7uL/yTvF2xWmoC4wTxfRq/ob9ipwvCSeHBtq72pH+tvqYIrZxCHYJAdRKB\nag4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T13:08:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Avinash-1994/lunx/commit/d957fdc40f9a666415b1ef686c6263d4744e5895","node_id":"C_kwDOQaAwKtoAKGQ5NTdmZGM0MGY5YTY2NjQxNWIxZWY2ODZjNjI2M2Q0NzQ0ZTU4OTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Avinash-1994/lunx/commit/3d6da6042c7af417f292cec87484f5caa3355d4a","sha":"3d6da6042c7af417f292cec87484f5caa3355d4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/3d6da6042c7af417f292cec87484f5caa3355d4a"}],"sha":"d957fdc40f9a666415b1ef686c6263d4744e5895","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-19