it":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:52:31Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:52:31Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix: pre-publish issues found installing the packed tarball\n\n- Dev server: with the JS watcher, the config watcher watched the project\n  directory and took any file change (even its own log) for a config\n  change, restarting in a loop across hundreds of ports. Only config\n  files count now; a restart closes connections so the port is reused,\n  and no longer crashes on a ws server without close().\n- The optional native helpers are not published for every platform yet:\n  their absence is no longer a warning (it named SWC / LightningCSS,\n  which lunx no longer uses); LUNX_DEBUG=1 still reports it.\n- engines.node: ^20.19.0 || >=22.12.0, what Rolldown requires.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA","tree":{"sha":"84723b857edfc898a9b727bdb3491af176187979","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/trees/84723b857edfc898a9b727bdb3491af176187979"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/commits/eada535cc336a688e7ccfd344881c4985f0ab6bb","verification":{"payload":"tree 84723b857edfc898a9b727bdb3491af176187979\nparent 9310e5a21ff1a90092b0c504ab09068a50633a23\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791201151 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791201151 +0000\n\nfix: pre-publish issues found installing the packed tarball\n\n- Dev server: with the JS watcher, the config watcher watched the project\n  directory and took any file change (even its own log) for a config\n  change, restarting in a loop across hundreds of ports. Only config\n  files count now; a restart closes connections so the port is reused,\n  and no longer crashes on a ws server without close().\n- The optional native helpers are not published for every 