ne resolver.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA","tree":{"sha":"b4e42e3eb33053b38f3d71ffc8ff2f1617e040a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/trees/b4e42e3eb33053b38f3d71ffc8ff2f1617e040a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/commits/a4be43a597fcc61b3687a14bf27635281e2ea0cb","verification":{"payload":"tree b4e42e3eb33053b38f3d71ffc8ff2f1617e040a3\nparent ec9bed42faf0aaf6a1717993ee6a174d3bd65a26\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791198618 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791198618 +0000\n\nfeat(plugin-host): esbuild optimizer plugins run on Rolldown\n\nVite 5-7 plugins hand the dependency optimizer esbuild plugins through\noptimizeDeps.esbuildOptions.plugins. Their setup(build) now runs against\na recording build object and its onResolve / onLoad / onStart / onEnd\ncallbacks replay as Rolldown hooks: namespaces become \\0esbuild:<ns>:<path>\nids, loaders map to module types, resolveDir and pluginData carry over,\nand build.resolve uses the engine resolver.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFykOqNl\nyDT9cGpyi59/jGiRkxGX14FvFipJ7db4vhJC04uYapaWSGOvx9lQoFIDwxFaGCp0ReybdUqXZmnZ\nZgw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T11:10:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gis