er","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/ec9bed42faf0aaf6a1717993ee6a174d3bd65a26/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:07:46Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:07:46Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"test(browser-matrix): interaction checks for the last 8 fixtures\n\nvanilla-ts, jQuery, three, Tailwind, styled-components, React Router,\nVue Router and Sass now render a counter that the matrix clicks in dev\nand in the production preview, so no check is skipped: 133/133 pass.\nPartial runs (--only) update their rows of the report instead of\nreplacing it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA","tree":{"sha":"fb1a3c96fdeab34f6cdfa4e8d363daf7b530f0ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/trees/fb1a3c96fdeab34f6cdfa4e8d363daf7b530f0ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/commits/ec9bed42faf0aaf6a1717993ee6a174d3bd65a26","verification":{"payload":"tree fb1a3c96fdeab34f6cdfa4e8d363daf7b530f0ca\nparent eb298b29ef2751777663eea57337acc98b35730b\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791198466 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791198466 +0000\n\ntest(browser-matrix): interaction checks for the last 8 fixtures\n\nvanilla-ts, jQuery, three, Tailwind, styled-components, React Router,\nVue Router and Sass now render a counter that the matrix clicks in dev\nand in the production preview, so no check is skipped: 133/133 pass.\nPartial runs (--only) update their rows of the report instead of\nreplacing it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMA