ved_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/3a16622832d88e8dfe3ef870c158eaaaa30ed305/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T07:43:59Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T07:43:59Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(plugin-host): vite-node replaced by lunx''s module runner\n\nReact Router (route config loading, dev SSR) and Nuxt (page rendering\nin its Nitro worker) drive vite-node. vite-node/server, vite-node/client\nand vite-node/source-map now resolve to lunx: the server half serves\nmodules from lunx''s SSR pipeline and decides externalization, the runner\nevaluates module-runner code with Node imports for externals and keeps\nVite''s ModuleCacheMap API (invalidateDepTree…). Verified with the\nvite-node package removed: React Router and Nuxt dev/build pass, Nuxt\nhydrates and hot-updates.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA","tree":{"sha":"c11a1ed20240b669951390b4f8a18801abbd3fec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/trees/c11a1ed20240b669951390b4f8a18801abbd3fec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/commits/3a16622832d88e8dfe3ef870c158eaaaa30ed305","verification":{"payload":"tree c11a1ed20240b669951390b4f8a18801abbd3fec\nparent 6f3cb75ab0a54327d170f07d26c820d7d212692f\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790927039 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790927039 +0000\n\nfeat(plugin-host): vite-node replaced by lunx''s module runner\n\nReact Router (route config loading, dev SSR) and Nuxt (page rendering\nin its Nitro worker) drive vite-node. vite-node/server, vite-node/client\nand vite-node/source-map now resolve to lunx: the server half serves\nmodules from lunx''s SSR pipeline and decides externalization, the runner\nevaluates module-runner code with Node imports for externals and keeps\nVite''s ModuleCacheMap API (invalidateDepTree…). Verified with the\nvite-node package removed: React Router and Nuxt dev/build pass, Nuxt\nhydrates and hot-updates.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQIF8tWrs\nWdaDc1K/z6k4hoxBi/gObxQG7jo+W45sY7nNnxm845HjLQ6q4DZuUqCapVVZNsxCgw7//C2pbxtX\nggI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T07:44:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Avinash-1994/lunx/commit/3a16622832d88e8dfe3ef870c158eaaaa30ed305","node_id":"C_kwDOQaAwKtoAKDNhMTY2MjI4MzJkODhlOGRmZTNlZjg3MGMxNThlYWFhYTMwZWQzMDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Avinash-1994/lunx/commit/6f3cb75ab0a54327d170f07d26c820d7d212692f","sha":"6f3cb75ab0a54327d170f07d26c820d7d212692f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/6f3cb75ab0a54327d170f07d26c820d7d212692f"}],"sha":"3a16622832d88e8dfe3ef870c158eaaaa30ed305","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/3a16622832d88e8dfe3ef870c158eaaaa30ed305"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/6f3cb75ab0a54327d170f07d26c820d7d212692f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T07:41:08Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T07:41:08Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(plugin-host): Nitro bundles on lunx, no Rollup\n\nNuxt and SolidStart package their servers with Nitro, which drives\nRollup and Rollup''s resolve/commonjs/json/terser plugins. Those imports\nnow resolve to lunx: rollup()/watch() run on lunx''s engine\n(engines/rollup-compat.ts), and the four plugins become markers whose\noptions map to the engine''s native resolution, CommonJS, JSON and\nminification. Verified with the rollup package removed: Nuxt and\nSolidStart dev, build and production servers all work.\n\nThe loader now holds one redirect table (by specifier and by resolved\nfile path) for every tool lunx stands in for.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA","tree":{"sha":"d081711597c53d10ba70561e3fc112a8d9d59702","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/trees/d081711597c53d10ba70561e3fc112a8d9d59702"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/commits/6f3cb75ab0a54327d170f07d26c820d7d212692f","verification":{"payload":"tree d081711597c53d10ba70561e3fc112a8d9d59702\nparent e4ecb0b8c3e45378df3efa1f39045276b26b5a45\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790926868 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790926868 +0000\n\nfeat(plugin-host): Nitro bundles on lunx, no Rollup\n\nNuxt and SolidStart package their servers with Nitro, which drives\nRollup and Rollup''s resolve/commonjs/json/terser plugins. Those imports\nnow resolve to lunx: rollup()/watch() run on lunx''s engine\n(engines/rollup-compat.ts), and the four plugins become markers whose\noptions map to the engine''s native resolution, CommonJS, JSON and\nminification. Verified with the rollup package removed: Nuxt and\nSolidStart dev, build and production servers all work.\n\nThe loader now holds one redirect table (by specifier and by resolved\nfile path) for every tool lunx stands in for.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfF