gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/82090280b6faab3c646d2ca7523474916d711ba3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T06:43:37Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T06:43:37Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(vite-host): Waku (React Server Components) runs on lunx\n\nWaku''s CLI runs in-process on lunx: dev with React Server Components\n(RSC environment, client components hydrating, server-component HMR\nwith client state kept) and the five-environment build plus static\ngeneration, all on lunx + Rolldown.\n\n- SPA-style HTML entries in builds (Vite''s build-html): module scripts\n  and stylesheets become the entry, the page gets the built chunk,\n  preloads and CSS, transformIndexHtml hooks applied\n- dependency pre-bundling for server environments that list\n  optimizeDeps.include (React under react-server); CommonJS export\n  names read by evaluating with the environment''s conditions; aliased\n  imports matched to optimized deps by resolved file\n- file:// imports resolve like paths (plugin-rsc imports its runtime so)\n- dev.moduleRunnerTransform on for server environments (Vite 6)\n- build.rollupOptions and build.rolldownOptions are one object\n- import.meta.env defines merged into the client env object\n- import.meta.glob only rewrites real calls (AST), in dependencies and\n  virtual modules too\n- vite shim: parse/parseSync, parseAst/parseAstAsync, runnerImport\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA","tree":{"sha":"9b9d105b49e0274980f17aff4af4839cbbd36ea4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/trees/9b9d105b49e0274980f17aff4af4839cbbd36ea4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/commits/82090280b6faab3c646d2ca7523474916d711ba3","verification":{"payload":"tree 9b9d105b49e0274980f17aff4af4839cbbd36ea4\nparent 4366b1860fdec74e1e72dbc6539470fe48470b2d\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790923417 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790923417 +0000\n\nfeat(vite-host): Waku (React Server Components) runs on lunx\n\nWaku''s CLI runs in-process on lunx: dev with React Server Components\n(RSC environment, client components hydrating, server-component HMR\nwith client state kept) and the five-environment build plus static\ngeneration, all on lunx + Rolldown.\n\n- SPA-style HTML entries in builds (Vite''s build-html): module scripts\n  and stylesheets become the entry, the page gets the built chunk,\n  preloads and CSS, transformIndexHtml hooks applied\n- dependency pre-bundling for server environments that list\n  optimizeDeps.include (React under react-server); CommonJS export\n  names read by evaluating with the environment''s conditions; aliased\n  imports matched to optimized deps by resolved file\n- file:// imports resolve like paths (plugin-rsc imports its runtime so)\n- dev.moduleRunnerTransform on for server environments (Vite 6)\n- build.rollupOptions and build.rolldownOptions are one object\n- import.meta.env defines merged into the client env object\n- import.meta.glob only rewrites real calls (AST), in dependencies and\n  virtual modules too\n- vite shim: parse/parseSync, parseAst/parseAstAsync, runnerImport\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Ses