rl":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/cd6077cc9d78daf6c4f326d54972331ae9a3d10a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T06:20:06Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T06:20:06Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(vite-host): Astro runs on lunx\n\nAstro''s own CLI now runs in-process with ''vite'' pointing at lunx: dev\n(SSR pages, client scripts, scoped styles, HMR) and static builds go\nthrough lunx + Rolldown. Production pages get their CSS and scripts.\n\n- chunk.viteMetadata is attached to the chunk objects every plugin hook\n  receives (Rolldown hands each plugin fresh objects) and to the output\n- emitted CSS/assets carry a name (Astro finds stylesheets by it)\n- TS in virtual modules (page.astro?...&lang.ts) is compiled, as in Vite\n- import.meta.glob mentions inside dependencies are left alone\n- in-process framework CLIs get the --port option\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA","tree":{"sha":"729d70bfc93d36423763c999f228e77e7aa272ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/trees/729d70bfc93d36423763c999f228e77e7aa272ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/commits/cd6077cc9d78daf6c4f326d54972331ae9a3d10a","verification":{"payload":"tree 729d70bfc93d36423763c999f228e77e7aa272ea\nparent 3adcc16c0f14e261e02bd9326d9b66dba7a25871\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790922006 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790922006 +0000\n\nfeat(vite-host): Astro runs on lunx\n\nAstro''s own CLI now runs in-process with ''vite'' pointing at lunx: dev\n(SSR pages, client scripts, scoped styles, HMR) and static builds go\nthrough lunx + Rolldown. Production pages get their CSS and scripts.\n\n- chunk.viteMetadata is attached to the chunk objects every plugin hook\n  receives (Rolldown hands each plugin fresh objects) and to the output\n- emitted CSS/assets carry a name (Astro finds stylesheets by it)\n- TS in virtual modules (page.astro?...&lang.ts) is compiled, as in Vite\n- import.meta.glob mentions inside dependencies are left alone\n- in-process framework CLIs get the --port option\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOjXSX0h\nc37RIhpBLS/Pzxxj/rW1GFNFxsjJOimnDlRziFNvw+sAePcNg6djaKZ3UJbFvyoBOu26X03LlBPA\nWgs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T06:20:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Avinash-1994/lunx/commit/cd6077cc9d78daf6c4f326d54972331ae9a3d10a","node_id":"C_kwDOQaAwKtoAKGNkNjA3N2NjOWQ3OGRhZjZjNGYzMjZkNTQ5NzIzMzFhZTlhM2QxMGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Avinash-1994/lunx/commit/3adcc16c0f14e261e02bd9326d9b66dba7a25871","sha":"3adcc16c0f14e261e02bd9326d9b66dba7a25871","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/3adcc16c0f14e261e02bd9326d9b66dba7a25871"}],"sha":"cd6077cc9d78daf6c4f326d54972331ae9a3d10a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/cd6077cc9d78daf6c4f326d54972331ae9a3d10a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/3adcc16c0f14e261e02bd9326d9b66dba7a25871/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T06:14:45Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T06:14:45Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(vite-host): TanStack Start runs on lunx; Vite 6 builder and environments\n\nTanStack Start dev (SSR, hydration, HMR with state kept) and build\n(client + server through builder.buildApp) now run on lunx + Rolldown;\nthe production server output renders and hydrates.\n\n- createBuilder()/buildApp with per-environment builds and build state\n- configEnvironment hook; top-level resolve.(no)External reaches server\n  environments; glob patterns in noExternal (@tanstack/start**)\n- environment.runner (RunnableDevEnvironment)\n- optimizer: client environment''s optimizeDeps, nested includes\n  (a > b), no discovery from imports inside node_modules (as Vite),\n  built-ins warn instead of throwing, config files not scanned\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA","tree":{"sha":"737d96441150b2e561607ca2db509b41cf100f0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/trees/737d96441150b2e561607ca2db509b41cf100f0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/commits/3adcc16c0f14e261e02bd9326d9b66dba7a25871","verification":{"payload":"tree 737d96441150b2e561607ca2db509b41cf100f0f\nparent 77480e42fda632fbd09736abe2c4a0fafb22ed0e\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790921685 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790921685 +0000\n\nfeat(vite-host): TanStack Start runs on lunx; Vite 6 builder and environments\n\nTanStack Start dev (SSR, hydration, HMR with state kept) and build\n(client + server through builder.buildApp) now run on lunx + Rolldown;\nthe production server output renders and hydrates.\n\n- createBuilder()/buildApp with per-environment builds and build state\n- configEnvironment hook; top-level resolve.(no)External reaches server\n  environments; glob patterns in noExternal (@tanstack/start**)\n- environment.runner (RunnableDevEnvironment)\n- optimizer: client environment''s optimizeDeps, nested includes\n  (a > b), no discovery from imports inside node_modules (as Vite),\n  built-ins warn instead of throwing, config files not scanned\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3