uns load + transform\ndirectly, as Vite does, instead of going through the de-duplicated\ntransformRequest (Qwik loads its own segments while their request is in\nflight). Interactive dev (resumable click handlers) verified in Chromium.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA","tree":{"sha":"17577fe18b64cd65a4ae8c85a041a6f09aba37b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/trees/17577fe18b64cd65a4ae8c85a041a6f09aba37b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/commits/6a04ab9cabaad4e08a9f4a37579bb66fcbe44710","verification":{"payload":"tree 17577fe18b64cd65a4ae8c85a041a6f09aba37b2\nparent b6613f4f64307cafdb8817b088a9dc6e8889c7cc\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790921015 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790921015 +0000\n\nfeat(vite-host): Qwik City runs on lunx\n\nQwik City dev (ssr mode) and build now run on lunx''s host. Fix a\ndeadlock: the plugin context''s this.load() now runs load + transform\ndirectly, as Vite does, instead of going through the de-duplicated\ntransformRequest (Qwik loads its own segments while their request is in\nflight). Interactive dev (resumable click handlers) verified in Chromium.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMM5mB0m\n+J5XvTHn3fj3xRm89xcMAm/6IK+6pG3U69InsqWQ3QAkWqJK1gcHfnBDJsDm5HZhyNN7sya1/QOV\nwgA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T06:03:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Avinash-1994/lunx/commit/6a04ab9cabaad4e08a9f4a37579bb66fcbe44710","node_id":"C_kwDOQaAwKtoAKDZhMDRhYjljYWJhYWQ0ZTA4YTlmNGEzNzU3OWJiNjZmY2JlNDQ3MTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Avinash-1994/lunx/commit/b6613f4f64307cafdb8817b088a9dc6e8889c7cc","sha":"b6613f4f64307cafdb8817b088a9dc6e8889c7cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/b6613f4f64307cafdb8817b088a9dc6e8889c7cc"}],"sha":"6a04ab9cabaad4e08a9f4a37579bb66fcbe44710","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/6a04ab9cabaad4e08a9f4a37579bb66fcbe44710"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/b6613f4f64307cafdb8817b088a9dc6e8889c7cc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T05:58:04Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T05:58:04Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(vite-host): React Router runs on lunx; browser dependency pre-bundling\n\nReact Router v7 (framework mode) now runs on lunx: dev through the host\n(SSR via vite-node on lunx''s server, hydration, React Fast Refresh with\nstate kept) and build by running React Router''s own CLI in-process with\n''vite'' pointing at lunx, so its client + server builds go through\nRolldown. Production output serves and hydrates.\n\n- dependency optimizer: bare node_modules imports in the browser are\n  pre-bundled with Rolldown into node_modules/.vite/deps (CJS gets named\n  exports, shared chunks keep one React); project source is scanned up\n  front, later discoveries re-bundle and reload, as in Vite\n- process.env.NODE_ENV replaced in browser code (Vite''s client-inject)\n- server.ssrTransform, environment.reloadModule\n- build: Vite''s load fallback for ids with queries, manifest keys keep\n  the query, root-relative entry ids resolve against the root\n- NATIVE table per command: lunx as the vite CLI, or the framework''s own\n  CLI in-process\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA","tree":{"sha":"67b3e3a936b97c12e629e9c78c74bbe70caccb28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/trees/67b3e3a936b97c12e629e9c78c74bbe70caccb28"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/commits/b6613f4f64307cafdb8817b088a9dc6e8889c7cc","verification":{"payload":"tree 67b3e3a936b97c12e629e9c78c74bbe70caccb28\nparent ba92260f28e3a3f7d6d19ef21998fd4c7101585b\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790920684 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790920684 +0000\n\nfeat(vite-host): React Router runs on lunx; browser dependency pre-bundling\n\nReact Router v7 (framework mode) now runs on lunx: dev through the host\n(SSR via vite-node on lunx''s server, hydration, React Fast Refresh with\nstate kept) and build by running React Router''s own CLI in-process with\n''vite'' pointing at lunx, so its client + server builds go through\nRolldown. Production output serves and hydrates.\n\n- dependency optimizer: bare node_modules imports in the browser are\n  pre-bundled with Rolldown into node_modules/.vite/deps (CJS gets named\n  exports, shared chunks keep one React); project source is scanned up\n  front, later discoveries re-bundle and reload, as in Vite\n- process.env.NODE_ENV replaced in browser code (Vite''s client-inject)\n- server.ssrTransform, environment.reloadModule\n- build: Vite''s load fallback for ids with queries, manifest keys keep\n  the query, root-relative entry ids resolve against the root\n- NATIVE table per command: lunx as the vite CLI, or the framework''s own\n  CLI in-process\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQODuWY7M\nkhmaQSXUSsOWESqkaQjZx8fnMUe5jrNao+wn3CK9RdVTUztN6TOow8LJxLlXOXuAZ8iibrBXO/MW\n7go=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T05:58:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Avinash-1994/lunx/commit/b6613f4f64307cafdb8817b088a9dc6e8889c7cc","node_id":"C_kwDOQaAwKtoAKGI2NjEzZjRmNjQzMDdjYWZkYjg4MTdiMDg4YTlkYzZlODg4OWM3Y2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Avinash-1994/lunx/commit/ba92260f28e3a3f7d6d19ef21998fd4c7101585b","sha":"ba92260f28e3a3f7d6d19ef21998fd4c7101585b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/ba92260f28e3a3f7d6d19ef21998fd4c7101585b"}],"sha":"b6613f4f64307cafdb8817b088a9dc6e8889c7cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/b6613f4f64307cafdb8817b088a9dc6e8889c7cc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/ba92260f28e3a3f7d6d19ef21998fd4c7101585b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T05:49:26Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T05:49:26Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(vite-host): SvelteKit builds on lunx + Rolldown\n\nlunx build in a SvelteKit project now runs SvelteKit''s own build flow on\nlunx: the SSR build, the client build SvelteKit starts from writeBundle\n(vite.build() resolves to lunx), prerendering and the adapter. About\n1.8x faster than SvelteKit on Vite 7 (1.9s vs 3.4s on the test app),\nwith slightly smaller output.\n\n- build(): Vite''s build options on Rolldown; plugin hooks get\n  this.environment; compiled non-JS modules get moduleType ''js''\n- per-chunk CSS extraction with chunk.viteMetadata, hashed assets,\n  .vite/manifest.json, define/import.meta.env, publicDir copy\n- the vite redirect also catches Vite imported by file path\n  (SvelteKit''s import_peer) and is installed before any config loads\n- vite.config is evaluated fresh per build, as Vite does\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA","tree":{"sha":"93bf4b3bbe18afa4f302dedec3eaf39e2b1e4c3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/trees/93bf4b3bbe18afa4f302dedec3eaf39e2b1e4c3c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/commits/ba92260f28e3a3f7d6d19ef21998fd4c7101585b","verification":{"payload":"tree 93bf4b3bbe18afa4f302dedec3eaf39e2b1e4c3c\nparent 94e43fe1b66c9123ed3ee9663259f7013b5a35be\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790920166 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790920166 +0000\n\nfeat(vite-host): SvelteKit builds on lunx + Rolldown\n\nlunx build in a SvelteKit project now runs SvelteKit''s own build flow on\nlunx: the SSR build, the client build SvelteKit starts from writeBundle\n(vite.build() resolves to lunx), prerendering and the adapter. About\n1.8x faster than SvelteKit on Vite 7 (1.9s vs 3.4s on the test app),\nwith slightly smaller output.\n\n- build(): Vite''s build options on Rolldown; plugin hooks get\n  this.environment; compiled non-JS modules get moduleType ''js''\n- per-chunk CSS extraction with chunk.viteMetadata, hashed assets,\n  .vite/manifest.json, define/import.meta.env, publicDir copy\n- the vite redirect also catches Vite imported by file path\n  (SvelteKit''s import_peer) and is installed before any config loads\n- vite.config is evaluated fresh per build, as Vite does\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNwe22r1\nCN245M2iP9A13EBIDxCpTdJizeIoc+WfhCgqd6mUE5/kofikFPycrgYjJz09pLfYcNaWLU0Tvn4r\npQk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T05:49:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Avinash-1994/lunx/commit/ba92260f28e3a3f7d6d19ef21998fd4c7101585b","node_id":"C_kwDOQaAwKtoAKGJhOTIyNjBmMjhlM2EzZjdkNmQxOWVmMjE5OThmZDRjNzEwMTU4NWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Avinash-1994/lunx/commit/94e43fe1b66c9123ed3ee9663259f7013b5a35be","sha":"94e43fe1b66c9123ed3ee9663259f7013b5a35be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/94e43fe1b66c9123ed3ee9663259f7013b5a35be"}],"sha":"ba92260f28e3a3f7d6d19ef21998fd4c7101585b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/ba92260f28e3a3f7d6d19ef21998fd4c7101585b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/94e43fe1b66c9123ed3ee9663259f7013b5a35be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T05:41:57Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T05:41:57Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(vite-host): SvelteKit dev runs on lunx itself\n\nlunx dev in a SvelteKit project now runs SvelteKit''s own Vite plugins on\nlunx''s Vite-compatible host instead of spawning Vite: SSR through\nssrLoadModule (Rolldown''s module-runner transform), hydration, client\nmodules served from the plugin pipeline, and HMR over the vite-hmr\nprotocol. LUNX_VITE_HOST=0 falls back to the framework CLI; builds\nstill delegate for now.\n\n- dev server: connect-style middlewares with Vite''s names, ws hot\n  channel, watcher-driven HMR, transformIndexHtml, /@vite/client\n- ''vite'' module shim (normalizePath, loadEnv, transformWithOxc,\n  preprocessCSS, createServer…) installed with a module resolve hook\n- resolve: package #imports, unresolvable bare ids left to later\n  plugins (virtual modules); /@id/ URLs unwrapped in the module graph\n- ws: echo the requested Sec-WebSocket-Protocol (browsers require it)\n- define applies to dependencies in SSR, as in Vite\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA","tree":{"sha":"12612b26b92b7cf5d4562642e67ef0fffea63f4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/trees/12612b26b92b7cf5d4562642e67ef0fffea63f4f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/commits/94e43fe1b66c9123ed3ee9663259f7013b5a35be","verification":{"payload":"tree 12612b26b92b7cf5d4562642e67ef0fffea63f4f\nparent 2aa80d0a86f4d2ebd00ed4f6d557984a05fa5081\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790919717 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790919717 +0000\n\nfeat(vite-host): SvelteKit dev runs on lunx itself\n\nlunx dev in a SvelteKit project now runs SvelteKit''s own Vite plugins on\nlunx''s Vite-compatible host instead of spawning Vite: SSR through\nssrLoadModule (Rolldown''s module-runner transform), hydration, client\nmodules served from the plugin pipeline, and HMR over the vite-hmr\nprotocol. LUNX_VITE_HOST=0 falls back to the framework CLI; builds\nstill delegate for now.\n\n- dev server: connect-style middlewares with Vite''s names, ws hot\n  channel, watcher-driven HMR, transformIndexHtml, /@vite/client\n- ''vite'' module shim (normalizePath, loadEnv, transformWithOxc,\n  preprocessCSS, createServer…) installed with a module resolve hook\n- resolve: package #imports, unresolvable bare ids left to later\n  plugins (virtual modules); /@id/ URLs unwrapped in the module graph\n- ws: echo the requested Sec-WebSocket-Protocol (browsers require it)\n- define applies to dependencies in SSR, as in Vite\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFyEKSy2\ne3a0jMhWk4cG8rJ8C4cEbAjAgtB5FTIdolkB5ksvGodX7JvXO2cVHpN5BJEzKunGorZ9DiRxdUVy\nEQM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T05:42:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/