m","name":"Claude"},"message":"wip(vite-host): lunx-owned Vite plugin host (not wired in yet)\n\nGroundwork for building Vite-based meta-frameworks (SvelteKit, Nuxt,\nAstro, React Router, Qwik City) on lunx + Rolldown instead of their CLIs:\nconfig resolution with Vite 6 environments, plugin container with hook\nfilters, per-environment module graphs, transformRequest + ssrLoadModule\n(Rolldown''s module-runner transform), built-in resolve/css/oxc/json/\nasset/define/import-analysis plugins, HMR propagation, connect-style\nmiddlewares and the /@vite/client browser runtime. No command uses it\nyet; the dev server, ''vite'' shim and builds come next.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA","tree":{"sha":"eafae9bb010d598ee2dfa822146c2d8d2edfde77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/trees/eafae9bb010d598ee2dfa822146c2d8d2edfde77"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/commits/7561ed36d3f8552f9f9612b4233879e4bd2fc1a7","verification":{"payload":"tree eafae9bb010d598ee2dfa822146c2d8d2edfde77\nparent 00546c9913d7654f6a0387a75521f931c4b5b120\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790918566 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790918566 +0000\n\nwip(vite-host): lunx-owned Vite plugin host (not wired in yet)\n\nGroundwork for building Vite-based meta-frameworks (SvelteKit, Nuxt,\nAstro, React Router, Qwik City) on lunx + Rolldown instead of their CLIs:\nconfig resolution with Vite 6 environments, plugin container with hook\nfilters, per-environment module graphs, transformRequest + ssrLoadModule\n(Rolldown''s module-runner transform), built-in resolve/css/oxc/json/\nasset/define/import-analysis plugins, HMR propagation, connect-style\nmiddlewares and the /@vite/client browser runtime. No command uses it\nyet; the dev server, ''vite'' shim and builds come next.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Sessi