"site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/faa83154140a06270303cab90926eda257d662e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T04:42:53Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T04:42:53Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix: Qwik client-side clicks; lunx preview 404''d every asset\n\n- Plain scripts in dependencies (qwikloader, polyfills) were tree-shaken\n  away under their package''s sideEffects:false: in dev the prebundler\n  wrapped them as CommonJS, in production nothing kept them. Qwik\n  render() apps now handle clicks in dev and production.\n- lunx preview with base ''/'' resolved /assets/x.js to dist/.assets/x.js.\n- Browser matrix: Qwik is checked for interactivity, and production\n  output is served by the real lunx preview instead of a test server.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA","tree":{"sha":"430f039cf195924ea37a5250f380c216cf2b09ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/trees/430f039cf195924ea37a5250f380c216cf2b09ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/commits/faa83154140a06270303cab90926eda257d662e3","verification":{"payload":"tree 430f039cf195924ea37a5250f380c216cf2b09ff\nparent ab1417ac337af7a311847c31ba5be384133f6424\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790916173 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790916173 +0000\n\nfix: Qwik client-side clicks; lunx preview 404''d every asset\n\n- Plain scripts in dependencies (qwikloader, polyfills) were tree-shaken\n  away under their package''s sideEffects:false: in dev the prebundler\n  wrapped them as CommonJS, in production nothing kept them. Qwik\n  render() apps now handle clicks in dev and production.\n- lunx preview with base ''/'' resolved /assets/x.js to dist/.assets/x.js.\n- Browser matrix: Qwik is checked for interactivity, and production\n  output is served by the real lunx preview instead of a test server.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGpoEQUM\n7vdkLpoWYZMUSww11tvNe3/CLyq3Hq4cUraA/M0P6+gPjADTgdbet6hDe5J5ui8t2Omej2HKopz/\n3Qw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T04:42:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Avinash-1994/lunx/commit/faa83154140a06270303cab90926eda257d662e3","node_id":"C_kwDOQaAwKtoAKGZhYTgzMTU0MTQwYTA2MjcwMzAzY2FiOTA5MjZlZGEyNTdkNjYyZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Avina