 the deprecated inlineDynamicImports. TanStack E2E: match\nid=\"root\" (the fixture adds a data attribute).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA","tree":{"sha":"0d39bde743bf3dbb179a99cd4ee7d3c40bc2e981","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/trees/0d39bde743bf3dbb179a99cd4ee7d3c40bc2e981"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/commits/ab1417ac337af7a311847c31ba5be384133f6424","verification":{"payload":"tree 0d39bde743bf3dbb179a99cd4ee7d3c40bc2e981\nparent 1f870ebdf30e028f306e8e6fa4c63b00ea981131\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790915610 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790915610 +0000\n\nfix(meta): fall back to built-in support when the framework CLI is missing\n\nlunx dev/build/preview in a Nuxt/TanStack/... project without its CLI\ninstalled now warns and runs lunx''s own adapter instead of exiting 1\n(fixes Production Gate NUXT-05). The three duplicated delegation blocks\nbecome one maybeDelegate() helper. Rolldown 1.2: use codeSplitting:false\ninstead of the deprecated inlineDynamicImports. TanStack E2E: match\nid=\"root\" (the fixture adds a data attribute).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQDmX1tAr\nVFo9GAUFCZOqvfDw1UyTw2ZMWQX+GHt4/xsNxy7fNQJfCj5AF+J2jNgjWZ9+tuRuf1ZjX4A7prII\nrwE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T04:33:32Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.git