arred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/1f870ebdf30e028f306e8e6fa4c63b00ea981131/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T04:27:13Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T04:27:13Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(ci): lock every platform''s Rolldown binding; Rolldown 1.2.12\n\nThe lockfile was regenerated on Linux and only carried the linux-x64\nbindings (npm/cli#4828), so npm ci on macOS/Windows had no native\nbinding and 9 Jest suites failed to load. Also adds VitePress and\nSolidStart to the meta-framework matrix.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA","tree":{"sha":"8b60e7a0cf481703ab9c5a919b148987a579b92b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/trees/8b60e7a0cf481703ab9c5a919b148987a579b92b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/commits/1f870ebdf30e028f306e8e6fa4c63b00ea981131","verification":{"payload":"tree 8b60e7a0cf481703ab9c5a919b148987a579b92b\nparent 90988ead18920e0ce2971bc20294f3a737963256\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790915233 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790915233 +0000\n\nfix(ci): lock every platform''s Rolldown binding; Rolldown 1.2.12\n\nThe lockfile was regenerated on Linux and only carried the linux-x64\nbindings (npm/cli#4828), so npm ci on macOS/Windows had no native\nbinding and 9 Jest suites failed to load. Also adds VitePress and\nSolidStart to the meta-framework matrix.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAA