"name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T02:58:42Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"ci: fix lint, broken submodule links; src/internal -> src/lib\n\n- CI on master failed at npm ci (EBADPLATFORM from the Windows-only\n  @swc/core-win32-x64-msvc devDependency, already removed on this\n  branch) and every checkout warned about gitlinks without .gitmodules:\n  ten test-app folders were nested clones committed as submodules and\n  arrived empty. Removed from the index.\n- src/internal -> src/lib: these are lunx''s own libraries used across\n  the core; the governance rule reserves ''internal'' for code plugins\n  must not import, so every core import tripped it\n- no-undef off for TypeScript (tsc checks names, incl. type-only globals)\n- execute.ts: a literal backspace stood where \\b was meant, so the\n  legacy engine''s #imports rewrite could never match\n\nLocal CI run: lint 0 errors, typecheck, jest 29 suites / 393 tests,\ngovernance 4/4, npm run build incl. Rust engine verification.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA","tree":{"sha":"3f52e464ac31826e840ca2b19b7dfc0c088b639d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/trees/3f52e464ac31826e840ca2b19b7dfc0c088b639d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/commits/660fa631355ace88cdd644eed26ee12a6c4a1083","verification":{"payload":"tree 3f52e464ac31826e840ca2b19b7dfc0c088b639d\nparent 0685e61d41975aca2764f7da8f8d501fcff23a33\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790909922 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790909922 +0000\n\nci: fix lint, broken submodule links; src/internal -> src/lib\n\n- CI on master failed at npm ci (EBADPLATFORM from the Windows-only\n  @swc/core-win32-x64-msvc devDependency, already removed on this\n  branch) and every checkout warned about gitlinks without .gitmodules:\n  ten test-app folders were 