claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/0685e61d41975aca2764f7da8f8d501fcff23a33/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T12:16:53Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T12:16:53Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat: meta-frameworks via their own toolchains; matrix checks the UI reacts\n\nMeta-frameworks\n- lunx dev/build/preview detect Next.js, Nuxt, Astro, SvelteKit, React\n  Router, Remix, SolidStart, TanStack Start, Qwik City, Analog, Gatsby,\n  Docusaurus, VitePress, Waku, RedwoodJS, Stencil and Marko Run and run\n  the framework''s own CLI, saying so (delegate: false to opt out). The\n  previous adapters were scaffolding that a real project never reached.\n- scripts/meta-matrix.mjs (npm run test:meta): real Next.js, Astro,\n  SvelteKit, Nuxt and React Router v7 projects through lunx dev + build:\n  10/10.\n\nBrowser matrix (now 18 setups) clicks a counter in dev and production:\n- dev: dependency URLs carried ?v=..., but pre-bundled entries import\n  each other by relative path, so the browser loaded two copies (Preact\n  hooks crashed with __H)\n- dev: pre-bundle entries resolved by lunx''s resolver while imports inside\n  packages resolved by Rolldown with other conditions: two solid-js\n  copies, signals never updated. Entries are now bare specifiers.\n- Qwik: optimizer options were wrong (transpile vs transpileTs/Jsx), so\n  hmtBchandlers never became QRLs and production did not render. Renders,\n  HMR and builds now; client-only render() clicks remain a known issue.\n\nResults: matrix 117/126 (0 failed, 9 skipped), conformance 48/48.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA","tree":{"sha":"08b3e2484e543fdda68906f5790ef0992ced6290","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/trees/08b3e2484e543fdda68906f5790ef0992ced6290"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/commits/0685e61d41975aca2764f7da8f8d501fcff23a33","verification":{"payload":"tree 08b3e2484e543fdda68906f5790ef0992ced6290\nparent 3270844444f4d4d9ff5a445a8632bee7d5d72506\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790857013 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790857013 +0000\n\nfeat: meta-frameworks via their own toolchains; matrix checks the UI reacts\n\nMeta-frameworks\n- lunx dev/build/preview detect Next.js, Nuxt, Astro, SvelteKit, React\n  Router, Remix, SolidStart, TanStack Start, Qwik City, Analog, Gatsby,\n  Docusaurus, VitePress, Waku, RedwoodJS, Stencil and Marko Run and run\n  the framework''s own CLI, saying so (delegate: false to opt out). The\n  previous adapters were scaffolding that a real project never reached.\n- scripts/meta-matrix.mjs (npm run test:meta): real Next.js, Astro,\n  SvelteKit, Nuxt and React Router v7 projects through lunx dev + build:\n  10/10.\n\nBrowser matrix (now 18 setups) clicks a counter in dev and production:\n- dev: dependency URLs carried ?v=..., but pre-bundled entries import\n  each other by relative path, so the browser loaded two copies (Preact\n  hooks crashed with __H)\n- dev: pre-bundle entries resolved by lunx''s resolver while imports inside\n  packages resolved by Rolldown with other conditions: two solid-js\n  copies, signals never updated. Entries are now bare specifiers.\n- Qwik: optimizer options were wrong (transpile vs transpileTs/Jsx), so\n  hmtBchandlers never became QRLs and production did not render. Renders,\n  HMR and builds now; client-only render() clicks remain a known issue.\n\nResults: matrix 117/126 (0 failed, 9 skipped), conformance 48/48.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQArQhJFh\nIv+P6OuTVbwKk8ENFaWyvDXdfJzDcvP5qwCM1BF4CMM2RKVVEufetgJNupzb0ZV3wSHrCabxga+5\nrA0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T02:47:36Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Avinash-1994/lunx/commit/0685e61d41975aca2764f7da8f8d501fcff23a33","node_id":"C_kwDOQaAwKtoAKDA2ODVlNjFkNDE5NzVhY2EyNzY0ZjdkYThmOGQ1MDFmY2ZmMjNhMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Avinash-1994/lunx/commit/3270844444f4d4d9ff5a445a8632bee7d5d72506","sha":"3270844444f4d4d9ff5a445a8632bee7d5d72506","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/3270844444f4d4d9ff5a445a8632bee7d5d72506"}],"sha":"0685e61d41975aca2764f7da8f8d501fcff23a33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/0685e61d41975aca2764f7da8f8d501fcff23a33"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/3270844444f4d4d9ff5a445a8632bee7d5d72506/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T11:56:16Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T11:56:16Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"refactor: one compiler - Oxc/Rolldown replace @swc/core, esbuild and acorn\n\nRuntime dependencies are now rolldown, lightningcss, react-refresh and\nlunx''s own @lunx/adapter-core and @lunx/security. A fresh install is 9\npackages / 36 MB (published 1.0.2: 276 packages / 300 MB), and dev,\nbuild, pre-bundling, config loading, tests and library builds share one\ncompiler instead of drifting between three.\n\n- src/internal/oxc.ts: TS/JSX (incl. React Refresh), legacy decorators\n  with metadata (helpers inlined, no runtime package), define, minify,\n  ESTree parse\n- dev pre-bundler and on-demand dependency bundling on Rolldown; CJS\n  packages get static named exports through Rolldown''s interop, with\n  the same __esModule default as production\n- lunx.config / vite.config / postcss.config.ts loaded via Rolldown\n- lunx lib-build on Rolldown: ES, CJS and real UMD\n- test runner TS hooks, coverage, interop analysis, fix transforms\n- Solid: real reactive JSX via the project''s babel-preset-solid when\n  installed (as vite-plugin-solid uses); hyperscript fallback warns\n- react-refresh is a dependency so Fast Refresh works out of the box\n- @swc/core is an optional peer, needed only by the legacy engine\n  (module federation, SSR, node targets); a clear install hint if missing\n- dev: drop separate Sass/Less/Stylus plugins that ran before the shared\n  CSS compiler (stylesheets were preprocessed twice); Tailwind plugin\n  only without a PostCSS config\n- removed unreachable BuildPipeline and its never-run test\n\nVerified with esbuild, @swc/core and acorn removed from node_modules,\nrunning the built CLI: matrix 102/102, conformance 48/48; packed-install\nCLI surface 19/21, 0 crashes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA","tree":{"sha":"74b72ee9fc9257e7b960a1031187e4e9d21ec186","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/trees/74b72ee9fc9257e7b960a1031187e4e9d21ec186"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/commits/3270844444f4d4d9ff5a445a8632bee7d5d72506","verification":{"payload":"tree 74b72ee9fc9257e7b960a1031187e4e9d21ec186\nparent cb5495c8de1ff5ab0982754183c47d49ea8b0593\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790855776 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790855776 +0000\n\nrefactor: one compiler - Oxc/Rolldown replace @swc/core, esbuild and acorn\n\nRuntime dependencies are now rolldown, lightningcss, react-refresh and\nlunx''s own @lunx/adapter-core and @lunx/security. A fresh install is 9\npackages / 36 MB (published 1.0.2: 276 packages / 300 MB), and dev,\nbuild, pre-bundling, config loading, tests and library builds share one\ncompiler instead of drifting between three.\n\n- src/internal/oxc.ts: TS/JSX (incl. React Refresh), legacy decorators\n  with metadata (helpers inlined, no runtime package), define, minify,\n  ESTree parse\n- dev pre-bundler and on-demand dependency bundling on Rolldown; CJS\n  packages get static named exports through Rolldown''s interop, with\n  the same __esModule default as production\n- lunx.config / vite.config / postcss.config.ts loaded via Rolldown\n- lunx lib-build on Rolldown: ES, CJS and real UMD\n- test runner TS hooks, coverage, interop analysis, fix transforms\n- Solid: real reactive JSX via the project''s babel-preset-solid when\n  installed (as vite-plugin-solid uses); hyperscript fallback warns\n- react-refresh is a dependency so Fast Refresh works out of the box\n- @swc/core is an optional peer, needed only by the legacy engine\n  (module federation, SSR, node targets); a clear install hint if missing\n- dev: drop separate Sass/Less/Stylus plugins that ran before the shared\n  CSS compiler (stylesheets were preprocessed twice); Tailwind plugin\n  only without a PostCSS config\n- removed unreachable BuildPipeline and its never-run test\n\nVerified with esbuild, @swc/core and acorn removed from node_modules,\nrunning the built CLI: matrix 102/102, conformance 48/48; packed-install\nCLI surface 19/21, 0 crashes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCu9g1W4\nGO7dD4i3n1u5jpMAkOEGvDxrOEO1hBJJj727M9LV6X3bo+cLxiavvgtHsvao7pP7gfDvNvkja7