ts_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/6a49c87f4adb75ac2937247fcd1d3001504bc283/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T11:02:13Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T11:02:13Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat: import.meta.glob in dev and build (Vite-compatible)\n\nLazy and eager globs, import: ''name'', query (''?raw'', ''?url''), negative\npatterns, root-relative patterns, import.meta.globEager. Conformance\nsuite now 46/46 including glob and ?raw cases.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA","tree":{"sha":"fe2b6732b7e71bcf0e70bd4bb02bb6e79d3eb55f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/trees/fe2b6732b7e71bcf0e70bd4bb02bb6e79d3eb55f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/commits/6a49c87f4adb75ac2937247fcd1d3001504bc283","verification":{"payload":"tree fe2b6732b7e71bcf0e70bd4bb02bb6e79d3eb55f\nparent 3c12a0d95aee59c649e1bc337162d3e8314654de\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790852533 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790852533 +0000\n\nfeat: import.meta.glob in dev and build (Vite-compatible)\n\nLazy and eager globs, import: ''name'', query (''?raw'', ''?url''), negative\npatterns, root-relative patterns, import.meta.globEager. Conformance\nsuite now 46/46 including glob and ?raw cases.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQD8VLRop\nppMHPjxM20LzE0kANBDi+oMpXWVcQoispoYy467eGSZO79SXYSj/KJDzfgCxfQZ+gfG84+FLrWZD\nowI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T02:47:36Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Avinash-1994/lunx/commit/6a49c87f4adb75ac2937247fcd1d3001504bc283","node_id":"C_kwDOQaAwKtoAKDZhNDljODdmNGFkYjc1YWMyOTM3MjQ3ZmNkMWQzMDAxNTA0YmMyODM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Avinash-1994/lunx/commit/3c12a0d95aee59c649e1bc337162d3e8314654de","sha":"3c12a0d95aee59c649e1bc337162d3e8314654de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/3c12a0d95aee59c649e1bc337162d3e8314654de"}],"sha":"6a49c87f4adb75ac2937247fcd1d3001504bc283","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/6a49c87f4adb75ac2937247fcd1d3001504bc283"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/3c12a0d95aee59c649e1bc337162d3e8314654de/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T11:01:07Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T11:01:07Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat: library conformance suite (38/38) and the fixes it found\n\nscripts/library-conformance.mjs (npm run test:conformance) builds one app\nagainst local packages in every shape found on npm and checks each case\nin real Chromium, in dev and in the production build: CJS named/default/\nfunction/__esModule/NODE_ENV-switch/require chains, ESM-only, dual,\nexports conditions and subpath patterns, #imports, legacy browser field,\nmodule field, JSON, dynamic import, top-level await, module workers,\nwasm, and new URL(..., import.meta.url) assets.\n\nFixes:\n- dev pre-bundler emitted ''export const arguments'' for function exports\n  (a syntax error that blanked the page); now uses enumerable keys and\n  skips reserved words\n- dev: __esModule CJS default import is exports.default; legacy browser\n  field honoured\n- build: same __esModule semantics as dev (Rolldown used Node''s rule in\n  type:module apps, so dev and production disagreed)\n- build: new URL(''./x'', import.meta.url) emits the asset, or a separate\n  bundle for workers\n- CSP meta tag and _headers/.htaccess are opt-in (security.cspMeta,\n  security.headers): the generated policy blocked WebAssembly and any\n  cross-origin fetch. The policy is still written to lunx-csp.txt.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA","tree":{"sha":"c89fbceabe92e5002c4ef26d11dedad11cec22ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/trees/c89fbceabe92e5002c4ef26d11dedad11cec22ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/commits/3c12a0d95aee59c649e1bc337162d3e8314654de","verification":{"payload":"tree c89fbceabe92e5002c4ef26d11dedad11cec22ee\nparent 093030051e075923cd465571f7fa7dbf103211ff\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790852467 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790852467 +0000\n\nfeat: library conformance suite (38/38) and the fixes it found\n\nscripts/library-conformance.mjs (npm run test:conformance) builds one app\nagainst local packages in every shape found on npm and checks each case\nin real Chromium, in dev and in the production build: CJS named/default/\nfunction/__esModule/NODE_ENV-switch/require chains, ESM-only, dual,\nexports conditions and subpath patterns, #imports, legacy browser field,\nmodule field, JSON, dynamic import, top-level await, module workers,\nwasm, and new URL(..., import.meta.url) assets.\n\nFixes:\n- dev pre-bundler emitted ''export const arguments'' for function exports\n  (a syntax error that blanked the page); now uses enumerable keys and\n  skips reserved words\n- dev: __esModule CJS default import is exports.default; legacy browser\n  field honoured\n- build: same __esModule semantics as dev (Rolldown used Node''s rule in\n  type:module apps, so dev and production disagreed)\n- build: new URL(''./x'', import.meta.url) emits the asset, or a separate\n  bundle for workers\n- CSP meta tag and _headers/.htaccess are opt-in (security.cspMeta,\n  security.headers): the generated policy blocked WebAssembly and any\n  cross-origin fetch. The policy is still written to lunx-csp.txt.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQL3dLuUL\nRTMGBaNhzUBTPAzbzuprYCJ3/vKnO84odoVinqmDmh3AflWfaxhXKLf8Vhbgc/wufa3dDocQwz9O\n2gQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T02:47:36Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Avinash-1994/lunx/commit/3c12a0d95aee59c649e1bc337162d3e8314654de","node_id":"C_kwDOQaAwKtoAKDNjMTJhMGQ5NWFlZTU5YzY0OWUxYmMzMzcxNjJkM2U4MzE0NjU0ZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Avinash-1994/lunx/commit/093030051e075923cd465571f7fa7dbf103211ff","sha":"093030051e075923cd465571f7fa7dbf103211ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/093030051e075923cd465571f7fa7dbf103211ff"}],"sha":"3c12a0d95aee59c649e1bc337162d3e8314654de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/3c12a0d95aee59c649e1bc337162d3e8314654de"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/093030051e075923cd465571f7fa7dbf103211ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T10:55:10Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T10:55:10Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"perf(dev): boot 2.0s -> 0.3s on a large node_modules\n\n- pre-bundle only the dependencies the app imports (crawl from the\n  HTML entry) instead of every package.json dependency\n- pre-bundling runs in the background; HTML and the HMR client are\n  served immediately, module requests wait for it\n- drop the blocking full warmup build (LUNX_DEV_WARMUP=1 to keep it)\n- answer the first request as soon as the handler exists rather than\n  after watchers and diagnostics start; start init on listen\n- watcher: no recursive fs.watch on Linux, where Node walks and stats\n  the whole tree including node_modules and ignores ''ignored''\n- LUNX_DEBUG_BOOT=1 prints a boot phase breakdown\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA","tree":{"sha":"d908acb31bc70e2f5cc899304db5dab2a6c9eb4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/trees/d908acb31bc70e2f5cc899304db5dab2a6c9eb4c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/commits/093030051e075923cd465571f7fa7dbf103211ff","verification":{"payload":"tree d908acb31bc70e2f5cc899304db5dab2a6c9eb4c\nparent c77e1818d18eb92302c481d5115d392ac664c42d\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790852110 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790852110 +0000\n\nperf(dev): boot 2.0s -> 0.3s on a large node_modules\n\n- pre-bundle only the dependencies the app imports (crawl from the\n  HTML entry) instead of every package.json dependency\n- pre-bundling runs in the background; HTML and the HMR client are\n  served immediately, module requests wait for it\n- drop the blocking full warmup build (LUNX_DEV_WARMUP=1 to keep it)\n- answer the first request as soon as the handler exists rather than\n  after watchers and diagnostics start; start init on listen\n- watcher: no recursive fs.watch on Linux, where Node walks and stats\n  the whole tree including node_modules and ignores ''ignored''\n- LUNX_DEBUG_BOOT=1 prints a boot phase breakdown\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQD7Xmcdz\nqQ6IPNhpDjddO462t+3fnzTsyDSubL8NNSixiYBp3bv+ZRdgx2n41kX5yGFeXXMVYVdz/Vr0NwCG\nwgI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T02:47:36Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Avinash-1994/lunx/commit/093030051e075923cd465571f7fa7dbf103211ff","node_id":"C_kwDOQaAwKtoAKDA5MzAzMDA1MWUwNzU5MjNjZDQ2NTU3MWY3ZmE3ZGJmMTAzMjExZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Avinash-1994/lunx/commit/c77e1818d18eb92302c481d5115d392ac664c42d","sha":"c77e1818d18eb92302c481d5115d392ac664c42d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/c77e1818d18eb92302c481d5115d392ac664c42d"}],"sha":"093030051e075923cd465571f7fa7dbf103211ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/093030051e075923cd465571f7fa7dbf103211ff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/c77e1818d18eb92302c481d5115d392ac664c42d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T10:45:25Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T10:45:25Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat: run Vite and CRA apps unchanged; shared CSS pipeline\n\n- no lunx.config? lunx reads vite.config.* (evaluated, plugins\n  included): base, define, resolve.alias, server, build.outDir,\n  sourcemap, rollupOptions.input; framework plugins map to lunx''s\n  built-in compilers, other plugins run in the Rolldown build\n- lunx migrate: Vite (vite.config -> lunx.config.ts) and Create React\n  App (index.html from public/, scripts) migrations\n- resolve.alias and tsconfig/jsconfig paths in dev and build\n- define and env in dev; VITE_/REACT_APP_/PUBLIC_ prefixes exposed\n- fix: import.meta.env.DEV/PROD were the strings ''true''/''false'', so\n  dev-only branches survived production builds\n- JSX in .js (CRA convention) in dev and build\n- one CSS compiler for dev and build: project PostCSS (Tailwind etc),\n  Sass/Less/Stylus when installed, LightningCSS, CSS Modules with\n  composes, @import inlining, url() rewriting. Dev previously served\n  CSS untransformed and CSS Modules as a plain string.\n- dev: asset imports resolve to URLs, ?raw imports, CSS HMR replaces\n  the sheet in place instead of stacking <style> tags\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA","tree":{"sha":"c826478b14d44f3ccfa3482256519c5f7a55c9e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/trees/c826478b14d44f3ccfa3482256519c5f7a55c9e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/commits/c77e1818d18eb92302c481d5115d392ac664c42d","verification":{"payload":"tree c826478b14d44f3ccfa3482256519c5f7a55c9e8\nparent 1076b4f4a59485216679686d5dc435baec5e02ec\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790851525 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790851525 +0000\n\nfeat: run Vite and CRA apps unchanged; shared CSS pipeline\n\n- no lunx.config? lunx reads vite.config.* (evaluated, plugins\n  included): base, define, resolve.alias, server, build.outDir,\n  sourcemap, rollupOptions.input; framework plugins map to lunx''s\n  built-in compilers, other plugins run in the Rolldown build\n- lunx migrate: Vite (vite.config -> lunx.config.ts) and Create React\n  App (index.html from public/, scripts) migrations\n- resolve.alias and tsconfig/jsconfig paths in dev and build\n- define and env in dev; VITE_/REACT_APP_/PUBLIC_ prefixes exposed\n- fix: import.meta.env.DEV/PROD were the strings ''true''/''false'', so\n  dev-only branches survived production builds\n- JSX in .js (CRA convention) in dev and build\n- one CSS compiler for dev and build: project PostCSS (Tailwind etc),\n  Sass/Less/Stylus when installed, LightningCSS, CSS Modules with\n  composes, @import inlining, url() rewriting. Dev previously served\n  CSS untransformed and CSS Modules as a plain string.\n- dev: asset imports resolve to URLs, ?raw imports, CSS HMR replaces\n  the sheet in place instead of stacking <style> tags\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQDO7WQwh\nPuIP8EzJdFlpKILMzj1on/ZfBrN8SY0mJ8xX+9C9TO+fpiPoYMgcpwt7sD6UAVCOl4OqI/uWHRnt\n7gM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T02:47:36Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Avinash-1994/lunx/commit/c77e1818d18eb92302c481d5115d392ac664c42d","node_id":"C_kwDOQaAwKtoAKGM3N2UxODE4ZDE4ZWI5MjMwMmM0ODFkNTExNWQzOTJhYzY2NGM0MmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Avinash-1994/lunx/commit/1076b4f4a59485216679686d5dc435baec5e02ec","sha":"1076b4f4a59485216679686d5dc435baec5e02ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/1076b4f4a59485216679686d5dc435baec5e02ec"}],"sha":"c77e1818d18eb92302c481d5115d392ac664c42d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/c77e1818d18eb92302c481d5115d392ac664c42d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/1076b4f4a59485216679686d5dc435baec5e02ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T10:36:10Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T10:36:10Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(build): Rolldown production engine; real HMR across frameworks\n\nBuild\n- lunx build now bundles with Rolldown (Rust; the engine behind Vite 8):\n  native resolution incl. exports/imports maps, oxc TS/JSX, scope\n  hoisting, tree shaking, splitting and minify. Lunx plugins add HTML\n  entries, Vue/Svelte/Solid/Preact/Angular compilers, LightningCSS\n  (+ project PostCSS, CSS modules, url() assets, @import), static\n  assets with inlining, ?raw/?url/?inline, env defines, public/, and\n  .gz/.br output. Legacy engine kept for federation/SSR and\n  build.bundler: ''legacy''.\n- new config: build.bundler, base, define, resolve.alias\n- fixes svelte/solid production builds (#client/* subpath imports)\n- fix literal ''\\n'' written into HTML by CSP meta injection\n\nHMR\n- one runtime (/@lunx/hmr-client) with Vite-compatible import.meta.hot;\n  modules previously registered accept() on a second runtime under a\n  different id, so updates were silently dropped\n- React: real Fast Refresh with per-module registration (state kept)\n- Vue: __VUE_HMR_RUNTIME__ reload; Svelte 5: compiler hmr output\n- modules with no hot-apply now reload instead of swallowing edits\n- runtime ships in dist/ (packages/lunx-hmr-client was not packed)\n- dependency URLs use one version stamp per session; per-request\n  timestamps loaded duplicate copies of React/Vue\n\nbrowser-matrix: 42/42 on Linux, now also asserting production CSS.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA","tree":{"sha":"1df2567480005c9bb4d930b4f2101bdaff7f7d0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/trees/1df2567480005c9bb4d930b4f2101bdaff7f7d0b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/commits/1076b4f4a59485216679686d5dc435baec5e02ec","verification":{"payload":"tree 1df2567480005c9bb4d930b4f2101bdaff7f7d0b\nparent 371888b283119762ff37d754014f98036ad980b8\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790850970 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790850970 +0000\n\nfeat(build): Rolldown production engine; real HMR across frameworks\n\nBuild\n- lunx build now bundles with Rolldown (Rust; the engine behind Vite 8):\n  native resolution incl. exports/imports maps, oxc TS/JSX, scope\n  hoisting, tree shaking, splitting and minify. Lunx plugins add HTML\n  entries, Vue/Svelte/Solid/Preact/Angular compilers, LightningCSS\n  (+ project PostCSS, CSS modules, url() assets, @import), static\n  assets with inlining, ?raw/?url/?inline, env defines, public/, and\n  .gz/.br output. Legacy engine kept for federation/SSR and\n  build.bundler: ''legacy''.\n- new config: build.bundler, base, define, resolve.alias\n- fixes svelte/solid production builds (#client/* subpath imports)\n- fix literal ''\\n'' written into HTML by CSP meta injection\n\nHMR\n- one runtime (/@lunx/hmr-client) with Vite-compatible import.meta.hot;\n  modules previously registered accept() on a second runtime under a\n  different id, so updates were silently dropped\n- React: real Fast Refresh with per-module registration (state kept)\n- Vue: __VUE_HMR_RUNTIME__ reload; Svelte 5: compiler hmr output\n- modules with no hot-apply now reload instead of swallowing edits\n- runtime ships in dist/ (packages/lunx-hmr-client was not packed)\n- dependency URLs use one version stamp per session; per-request\n  timestamps loaded duplicate copies of React/Vue\n\nbrowser-matrix: 42/42 on Linux, now also asserting production CSS.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEv+AoLB\nmTL1peAgqpVSGBvbLBu9gwPP3lgLYD8/3A1rz6OZHSDkvo3XJaFBvv69IWq94T8bbeHk2z55W0rB\n6Qk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T02:47:36Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","