ade\n  npm ci fail with EBADPLATFORM on Linux and macOS\n- dev server and preview fall back to 0.0.0.0 when the host has no IPv6;\n  binding :: failed with EAFNOSUPPORT and the port probe treated every\n  error as ''in use'', looping forever\n- browser matrix accepts CHROMIUM_PATH for a pre-installed browser\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA","tree":{"sha":"4f75d9507a07a01b118089a8a828b94869d9e41d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/trees/4f75d9507a07a01b118089a8a828b94869d9e41d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/commits/371888b283119762ff37d754014f98036ad980b8","verification":{"payload":"tree 4f75d9507a07a01b118089a8a828b94869d9e41d\nparent 86f7bc1def1e14d4d140dca6fbfea8b7963b0042\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790849913 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790849913 +0000\n\nfix: install and dev server on Linux / IPv4-only hosts\n\n- drop Windows-only @swc/core-win32-x64-msvc devDependency that made\n  npm ci fail with EBADPLATFORM on Linux and macOS\n- dev server and preview fall back to 0.0.0.0 when the host has no IPv6;\n  binding :: failed with EAFNOSUPPORT and the port probe treated every\n  error as ''in use'', looping forever\n- browser matrix accepts CHROMIUM_PATH for a pre-installed browser\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVEhHyStzvYYtG56pF6EzA\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQM5wBzPc\nM4neMUk9ZlIn8R3TCZeEQUlfRXeqeY3iYf4UN7aZ1yUkkfRhWEw9TYJZ2HXtwRh3u4kwG4b9tTs+\nCw8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T02:47:36Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"