/cache files.\n\n2. Fixed TS1205 in extensions/vscode-lsp/server/src/index.ts:\n   - Changed ''export { ..., CompletionItem, Diagnostic }'' to ''export { ..., type CompletionItem, type Diagnostic }''\n   - Allows ''tsc --noEmit'' to pass cleanly across all jobs.","tree":{"sha":"51fc45680517822efabc15ecf0595cd47b9cbe0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/trees/51fc45680517822efabc15ecf0595cd47b9cbe0d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/commits/382a7d32bc80f7124489fa593dc007a5565fde24","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78060019?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Avinash-1994","id":78060019,"login":"Avinash-1994","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MDYwMDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Avinash-1994/lunx/commit/382a7d32bc80f7124489fa593dc007a5565fde24","node_id":"C_kwDOQaAwKtoAKDM4MmE3ZDMyYmM4MGY3MTI0NDg5ZmE1OTNkYzAwN2E1NTY1ZmRlMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Avinash-1994/lunx/commit/d761022b8e1cf0fd86b6c0b98a06cc301b33052b","sha":"d761022b8e1cf0fd86b6c0b98a06cc301b33052b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/d761022b8e1cf0fd86b6c0b98a06cc301b33052b"}],"sha":"382a7d32bc80f7124489fa593dc007a5565fde24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/382a7d32bc80f7124489fa593dc007a5565fde24"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78060019?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Avinash-1994","id":78060019,"login":"Avinash-1994","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MDYwMDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/d761022b8e1cf0fd86b6c0b98a06cc301b33052b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T05:55:42Z","email":"pavinash469@gmail.com","name":"Avinash-1994"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T05:55:42Z","email":"pavinash469@gmail.com","name":"Avinash-1994"},"message":"feat(dx): framework auto-detection + rich IntelliSense JSDoc\n\nComparison with Vite/Turbopack revealed 2 key DX gaps:\n\n1. Framework auto-detection from package.json (like Vite)\n   - NEW: detectFramework(root) scans package.json deps\n   - Priority: SSR meta-frameworks > Desktop > SPA > vanilla\n   - Detects: react, vue, svelte, angular, solid, preact, lit, qwik\n             nuxt, sveltekit, remix, solidstart, next, astro,\n             analog, tanstack-start, waku, electron, tauri\n   - Result: lunx.config.ts can now be EMPTY or just {}\n   - User sees: ''[lunx] Framework auto-detected: react''\n   - Explicit framework: key still takes priority\n\n2. Rich JSDoc on every config field (like Vite)\n   src/config/types.ts — LunxBaseConfig fields now have:\n   - @default values\n   - @example code blocks\n   - Inline option descriptions\n   - Hover docs in VS Code / WebStorm\n\nDX comparison result:\n  Vite   3 lines to start a React app  ✅\n  Lunx   0 lines (empty config)        ✅ (now matches)\n\nVerified: tsc --noEmit 0 errors, 28/28 tests pass","tree":{"sha":"889342236e61853c36051a443e9cd78f9937cceb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/trees/889342236e61853c36051a443e9cd78f9937cceb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/commits/d761022b8e1cf0fd86b6c0b98a06cc301b33052b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78060019?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Avinash-1994","id":78060019,"login":"Avinash-1994","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MDYwMDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994","user_vie