wMDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avinash-1994","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/commits/3b5b46c4afc3e9577bc6a817c423824e615ea45f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T12:03:43Z","email":"pavinash469@gmail.com","name":"Avinash-1994"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T12:03:43Z","email":"pavinash469@gmail.com","name":"Avinash-1994"},"message":"feat: add public reproducible benchmark suite (Fix #5)\n\nbenchmarks/public/ contains:\n  run-all.mjs          — orchestrates all 4 benchmarks\n  bench-hmr.mjs        — HMR latency: p50/p95/p99\n  bench-cold-build.mjs — cold build (cache wiped): 5 runs, median\n  bench-warm-build.mjs — warm build (cache intact): 5 runs, median\n  bench-cache.mjs      — SQLite cache hit rate: 1000 lookups\n  fixtures/react-basic — canonical benchmark fixture\n  README.md            — clone + run in 3 commands\n\nResults on Intel i7-13650HX / 23GB RAM / Linux x64 / Node v20.19.5:\n  HMR p50:        0.001ms  p95: 0.003ms  p99: 0.012ms  ✅\n  Cold build:     296ms median                          ✅ (≤400ms)\n  Warm build:     303ms median                          ✅ (≤400ms)\n  Cache hit rate: 99.00%                                ✅ (≥99%)\n\nAll results within 20% of baseline. Clone and verify with:\n  git clone https://github.com/Avinash-1994/lunx\n  cd benchmarks/public && npm install && node run-all.mjs","tree":{"sha":"9eaff9c41a791ff3c224f8aa61e00e67056e9506","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avinash-1994/lunx/git/trees/9eaff9c41a791ff3c224f8aa61e00e67056e