character list with interactive cards and favorites\n\nRefactors the main application to display characters using a dedicated `CharactersList` component.\n\nThis change introduces:\n- A responsive `CharactersList` component that displays characters as interactive cards (`Tarjeta`) from `rick-morty-components-lib`.\n- Favoriting functionality using a new `useFavorite` hook, allowing users to mark and unmark characters as favorites.\n- Tab-based filtering to switch between \"All\" characters and \"Favorites\".\n- Dynamic card variants based on device type detected by the new `useDeviceType` hook.\n- An `Empty` component to provide user feedback when no characters are available in a selected tab.\n- Integration of `ThemeProvider` for consistent styling from the shared component library.\n- Cleanup of unused boilerplate CSS in `App.css` and addition of new responsive styles for the card container.","tree":{"sha":"5550ae0a1941b31d988b81005476ce564aee38ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cristianmgb/rick-morty-characters-mfe/git/trees/5550ae0a1941b31d988b81005476ce564aee38ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cristianmgb/rick-morty-characters-mfe/git/commits/bc6c6bd3aa57e62a1410083c41ce21da4a29053b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4694439?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cristianmgb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cristianmgb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cristianmgb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cristianmgb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cristianmgb","id":4694439,"login":"cristianmgb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2OTQ0Mzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cristianmgb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cristianmgb/received_events","repos_url":"https://